"arcade_ms-pac-man","Ms. Pac-Man","arcade","Arcade","Arcade","Ýmsir (Namco, Sega, Capcom, Konami, Taito, SNK, Atari, o.fl.)","Arcade (Öll tímabil)","1981-01-01","1981","1980s","Coleco Industries","Coleco Industries","Action","Action","1-2","1","2","90","4.5","In this, the first proper sequel to Namco's legendary pill eating maze game, players must once again run around a number of mazes, eating all of the pills that are scattered throughout. The ever-present ghosts (Blinky, Pinky, Inky and Sue) return to hamper the player's progress. The infamous 'Power Pills' are also present and correct, with four appearing in each maze. 

