"arcade_moon-cresta","Moon Cresta","arcade","Arcade","Arcade","Ýmsir (Namco, Sega, Capcom, Konami, Taito, SNK, Atari, o.fl.)","Arcade (Öll tímabil)","1980-01-01","1980","1980s","Nichibutsu","Nichibutsu","Shoot'em Up / Vertical","Shooter","1-2","1","2","70","3.5","Moon Cresta is a single screen shoot-em-up with the player controlling an armed ship that moves horizontally along the bottom of the screen and must use their ship to destroy waves of attacking aliens. 

