"arcade_ironman-ivan-stewart-s-super-off-road","Ironman Ivan Stewart's Super Off-road","arcade","Arcade","Arcade","Ýmsir (Namco, Sega, Capcom, Konami, Taito, SNK, Atari, o.fl.)","Arcade (Öll tímabil)","1989-01-01","1989","1980s","Leland","Leland","Racing, Driving","Racing","1-3","1","3","90","4.5","In his never ending quest for adventure and excitement, man invented off-road racing. These races were then brought before the masses by converting huge sports stadiums into dirt and mud obstacle courses in which off-road 'Ironmen' battled for top honors. 

