"arcade_lee-trevino-s-fighting-golf","Lee Trevino's Fighting Golf","arcade","Arcade","Arcade","Ýmsir (Namco, Sega, Capcom, Konami, Taito, SNK, Atari, o.fl.)","Arcade (Öll tímabil)","1988-01-01","1988","1980s","SNK","SNK","Sports / Golf","Sports","1-2","1","2","50","2.5","1 to 4 players can tee it up on either an 18 hole American course or an 18 hole Japanese course. Players 1 &amp; 3 share controller 1 and players 2 &amp; 4 share controller 2.Game modes are:
