The game alternates between ""Tin Can Round"" and ""Bear Round"" boards. The ""Tin Can Round"" is a shooting gallery similar to Carnival, where the player must shoot all the cans and bottles while fending off enemy ducks. A bonus ""Duck-Frenzy Round"" can be entered by racking up cans to spell out the word on the top row. The ""Bear Round"" involves shooting a polar bear to change its direction and guide it to eat all the fish without falling off the ice floe.","razmataz.zip","ZIP","0.05","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/arcade/razmataz.png","miximages/arcade/razmataz.png","screenshots/arcade/razmataz.png","titlescreens/arcade/razmataz.png","3dboxes/arcade/razmataz.png","backcovers/arcade/razmataz.png","marquees/arcade/razmataz.png"
