The simplicity of the original Gauntlet series is still here: You have to find your way out of a maze using keys, secret passages, and switches. In your way are hordes and hordes of enemies, endlessly reproducing themselves from generators painfully spread around the gigantic, menacing levels.","gauntleg.zip","ZIP","0.25","true","true","true","true","true","false","true","true","covers/arcade/gauntleg.png","miximages/arcade/gauntleg.png","screenshots/arcade/gauntleg.png","titlescreens/arcade/gauntleg.png","3dboxes/arcade/gauntleg.png","","marquees/arcade/gauntleg.png"
