Power-ups may appear on some levels, and allow the player to shoot exploding bullets or attach bombs directly onto enemy aliens. However, the exploding bullets usable in Space World can only obtained in Maze World, and the power-up to attach bombs onto enemies in Maze World only appears in Space World. Players must alternate turns on the screen in the multiplayer mode.","warpwarp.zip","ZIP","0.01","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/arcade/warpwarp.png","miximages/arcade/warpwarp.png","screenshots/arcade/warpwarp.png","titlescreens/arcade/warpwarp.png","3dboxes/arcade/warpwarp.png","backcovers/arcade/warpwarp.png","marquees/arcade/warpwarp.png"
