"arcade_yie-ar-kung-fu","Yie Ar Kung-Fu","arcade","Arcade","Arcade","Ýmsir (Namco, Sega, Capcom, Konami, Taito, SNK, Atari, o.fl.)","Arcade (Öll tímabil)","1985-01-01","1985","1980s","Konami","Konami","Fighting","Fighting","1-2","1","2","90","4.5","Yie Ar Kung-fu is a single-player one-on-one fighting game in which the player takes on the role of 'Oolong' who must fight and defeat eleven martial arts masters. His ulimate goal is to win the title of ""Grand Master"" and honour the memory of his father, who was killed while fighting the current grand master.

