"nes_exciting-baseball","Exciting Baseball","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1987-12-08","1987","1980s","Konami","Konami","Sports / Baseball","Sports","2","1","2","","","A baseball simulator, Exciting Baseball follows Exciting Billiards and Exciting Basket (better known as Double Dribble in the West) in Konami's series of sports games for the Famicom Disk System.

