In this solo game, you play a game of tennis with the beautiful model Kobayashi Hitomi.","Kobayashi Hitomi - Shocking Tennis (JP).fds","FDS","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/nes/Kobayashi Hitomi - Shocking Tennis (JP).png","miximages/nes/Kobayashi Hitomi - Shocking Tennis (JP).png","screenshots/nes/Kobayashi Hitomi - Shocking Tennis (JP).png","titlescreens/nes/Kobayashi Hitomi - Shocking Tennis (JP).png","3dboxes/nes/Kobayashi Hitomi - Shocking Tennis (JP).png","backcovers/nes/Kobayashi Hitomi - Shocking Tennis (JP).png","marquees/nes/Kobayashi Hitomi - Shocking Tennis (JP).png"
