"nes_super-boy-allan","Super Boy Allan","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1987-03-27","1987","1980s","Sunsoft","Sunsoft","Puzzle","Puzzle","1","1","1","60","3","In the game, Allan Colada journeys from his home in the foothills into the mountains to retrieve a remedy for his sister Leela's fever.

Super Boy Allan is the second game in Sunsoft's ""Intelligence Game"" edutainment series for the Famicom Disk System, featuring two different game modes.

