"nes_wardner-no-mori","Wardner No Mori","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1988-03-25","1988","1980s","Toaplan","Taito","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","","","Wardner no Mori  (Lit. Forest of Warnder) is a platform style arcade game developed by Toaplan and released by Taito in 1987. In America, the arcade game was released under the title Pyros. The player controls a character by the name of Dover through various forest stages in an attempt to save his kidnapped girlfriend from the evil Wardner. The simple run and jump controls are supplemented with the ability to throw balls of fire. Gold coins can be collected throughout the game and exchanged for extra abilities in a shop at the end of each level.","Wardner no Mori (JP).fds","FDS","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/nes/Wardner no Mori (JP).png","miximages/nes/Wardner no Mori (JP).png","screenshots/nes/Wardner no Mori (JP).png","titlescreens/nes/Wardner no Mori (JP).png","3dboxes/nes/Wardner no Mori (JP).png","backcovers/nes/Wardner no Mori (JP).png","marquees/nes/Wardner no Mori (JP).png"
"nes_wrecking-crew","Wrecking Crew","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1987-10-15","1987","1980s","Nintendo","Nintendo","Puzzle","Puzzle","1-2","1","2","60","3","Wrecking Crew is a platform action game for one or two players. You control Mario and Luigi who need to demolish various buildings. After each wall in the building has been destroyed, you move on to the next (and more difficult) building. Many of the buildings have a puzzle element to them; you may need to find the path to reach all of the walls without becoming trapped at a dead end. Wandering throughout the buildings are dangerous creatures and the construction foreman, all of whom will stop Mario and Luigi from completing their task. The game features 100 levels, or use the construction set and create and play your own buildings.","Wrecking Crew (JP).fds","FDS","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/nes/Wrecking Crew (JP).png","miximages/nes/Wrecking Crew (JP).png","screenshots/nes/Wrecking Crew (JP).png","titlescreens/nes/Wrecking Crew (JP).png","3dboxes/nes/Wrecking Crew (JP).png","backcovers/nes/Wrecking Crew (JP).png","marquees/nes/Wrecking Crew (JP).png"
