"nes_america-oudan-ultra-quiz-shijou-saidai-no-tatakai","America Oudan Ultra Quiz - Shijou Saidai No Tatakai","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1991-11-29","1991","1990s","Pixel","Tomy","Simulation","Strategy / Sim","1","1","1","","","This game has two modes: story and tournament. Tournament mode is the simpler one: you compete against seven opponents in a quiz that concerns various historical, geographical, social, and cultural aspects of United States of America. Some questions require you to choose ""yes"" or ""no"", while others present you a short list of possible answers, of which you should choose the correct one. The participants' responses are timed.

