This is a traditional action platform game. Asmik can jump and exhale steam from his nostrils to turn all his enemies into eggs. Those eggs can be eaten and later used for various purposes (during boss battles, acquiring upgrades at a shop that becomes available once you have completed a stage, etc.). Asmik dies if he comes into close contact with an enemy. Boss battles differ from the rest of the game, each one being a mini-game of its own, for example a rock-paper-scissors game during which Asmik uses his correct choices to gain time to proceed to the next stage.","Asmik-kun Land (Japan).zip","ZIP","0.1","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/nes/Asmik-kun Land (Japan).png","miximages/nes/Asmik-kun Land (Japan).png","screenshots/nes/Asmik-kun Land (Japan).png","titlescreens/nes/Asmik-kun Land (Japan).png","3dboxes/nes/Asmik-kun Land (Japan).png","backcovers/nes/Asmik-kun Land (Japan).png","marquees/nes/Asmik-kun Land (Japan).png"
