"nes_bible-adventures","Bible Adventures","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1991-01-01","1991","1990s","Wisdom Tree","Wisdom Tree","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","30","1.5","Bible Adventures contains three different side scrolling platform games, each with a different bible theme. 

