"nes_bio-senshi-dan-increaser-tono-tatakai","Bio Senshi Dan - Increaser Tono Tatakai","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1987-09-22","1987","1980s","Atlus","Jaleco","Adventure","Adventure","1","1","1","70","3.5","The year is 2081. The Earth has become a devastated planet, overrun by monsters, controlled by a mysterious entity known as Increaser. The only hope to save the beloved Earth lies with you, a young warrior named Dan. You are sent in a time machine to the year 1999, when the monster invasion was beginning. Your task is to find your way through monster-infested labyrinths and to defeat the Increaser – whatever he (or it) is.

