"nes_captain-america-and-the-avengers","Captain America and the Avengers","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1991-12-02","1991","1990s","Data East","Data East","Platform","Platformer","1-2","1","2","60","3","The Mandarin has knocked out Iron Man and Vision. This time it is personal.

You play as Captain America or Hawkeye. You must fight your way through various thugs to rescue Iron Man and Vision. This game is a side scroller, somewhat reminiscent of Bionic Commando in which you fight through a level then move to an overhead map to decide where to go next.

Captain America's attacks are: when he is standing, shield throw; when he is crouching, punch and when he is jumping, kick. Also, if you push twice in a direction, Cap can do a powerful forward charge with his shield for a short distance.

Hawkeye's attacks are all arrow shots. He can shoot left, right, up, upper-left or upper-right.

In battle mode, this is a two player, one-on-one battle. Player one chooses from Captain America or Hawkeye (the good guys) and player two chooses from Wizard, Ultron or Crossbones (the bad guys). You fight each other until one player has won three rounds.","Captain America and the Avengers (USA).zip","ZIP","0.14","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/nes/Captain America and the Avengers (USA).png","miximages/nes/Captain America and the Avengers (USA).png","screenshots/nes/Captain America and the Avengers (USA).png","titlescreens/nes/Captain America and the Avengers (USA).png","3dboxes/nes/Captain America and the Avengers (USA).png","backcovers/nes/Captain America and the Avengers (USA).png","marquees/nes/Captain America and the Avengers (USA).png"
"nes_captain-comic-the-adventure","Captain Comic : The Adventure","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1989-01-01","1989","1980s","Color Dreams","Color Dreams","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","50","2.5","""You are Captain Comic, galactic hero. Your mission is to recover three treasures from the planet Omsoc, which have been stolen away and hidden on the remote planet of Tambi.""

Captain Comic is a platformer featuring a huge nonlinear playfield divided into several different terrains. As Comic, you must search throughout Tambi for power ups and items that will aid you in your quest to recover the three treasures. The Captain's main weapon is 'Blastola Cola', a can of drink that allows him to hurl fireballs at his foes. For each can that he finds, an additional fireball can be thrown.

