"nes_dragon-ball-daimaou-fukkatsu","Dragon Ball - Daimaou Fukkatsu","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1988-08-12","1988","1980s","TOSE","Bandai","Role Playing Game","RPG","1-2","1","2","50","2.5","This is an adventure/RPG game based on the popular manga series ""Dragon Ball"". The story follows one of the series' episodes. Son Goku's friend Krillin is found dead after a fighting tournament. A demon's symbol is engraved on a note left near the body. Master Roshi says that an evil demon named Piccolo Daimaou appeared on the Earth again. It is up to Son Goku to find Piccolo and to revive his friend.

