"nes_dragon-ball-3-gokuuden","Dragon Ball 3 - Gokuuden","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1989-10-27","1989","1980s","TOSE","Bandai","Role Playing Game","RPG","1-2","1","2","","","The game is based on the famous Dragon Ball manga series, starring Son Goku, and spans a long time period of the hero's life. It begins with Son Goku being a mere child and meeting the mysterious Bulma who asks him to add her on her quest to find seven Dragon Balls, which can grant any wish. The game follows Son Goku becoming stronger, defeating many foes, and even getting married.

