"nes_ganbare-goemon-gaiden-2-tenka-no-zaihou","Ganbare Goemon Gaiden 2 - Tenka No Zaihou","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1992-01-03","1992","1990s","Konami","Konami","Role Playing Game","RPG","1-2","1","2","","","This is a sequel to the  first Ganbare Goemon Gaiden (side-story) RPG. Goemon, a cunning thief and an avid treasure hunting, has nothing to do and sits in his house, bored. But his trusty friend Ebisumaru has good news: there is a big treasure to find somewhere in a big city across the sea. Of course the treasure won't be just given to Goemon: he'll have to perform a dangerous mission before. The two friends board a ship and thus the journey begins...

