"nes_hokuto-no-ken-3-shinseiki-souzou-seiken-retsuden","Hokuto no Ken 3: Shinseiki Souzou Seiken Retsuden","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1989-10-19","1989","1980s","Shouei System","Toei Animation","Adventure","Adventure","1-2","1","2","","","This RPG is based on the animé series Hokuto no Ken, a.k.a. Fist of the North Star. In 1999, a demonic attack caused devastated the human population. In order to re-build the ruined world and to survive in a struggle against demon lords and their minions, mankind needs the power of the Northern Star. You take control of Kenshirou, the hero of the series, and his friends, in a quest to save the humanity and to defeat the evil.

