"nes_karaoke-studio-senyou-cassette-vol-1","Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 1","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1987-10-28","1987","1980s","TOSE","Bandai","Singing","Action","1","1","1","","","is a karaoke music video game designed for Nintendo's Family Computer, or Famicom. The game is packaged with a hardware expansion subsystem designed to be inserted into the Famicom cartridge slot, and with a microphone peripheral capable of detecting a human voice.","Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 1 (Japan).zip","ZIP","0.14","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 1 (Japan).png","miximages/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 1 (Japan).png","screenshots/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 1 (Japan).png","titlescreens/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 1 (Japan).png","3dboxes/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 1 (Japan).png","backcovers/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 1 (Japan).png","marquees/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 1 (Japan).png"
"nes_karaoke-studio-senyou-cassette-vol-2","Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 2","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1988-02-18","1988","1980s","TOSE","Bandai","Singing","Action","1","1","1","","","is the second and final expansion cassette for the Karaoke Studio music game designed by Bandai in 1987 for Nintendo's Famicom. It provides additional songs and other new content by plugging it directly into the Karaoke Studio subsystem. As an expansion, it does not come with the microphone peripheral provided by the base package.

Gameplay consists of singing along in a karaoke-manner to a series of Japanese pop songs. The player is scored on accuracy of singing. The songs have been converted into 8-bit format for use with the Famicom and as the music plays and the song's lyrics are shown, on-screen depictions of the song's themes are displayed in the background simultaneously.","Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 2 (Japan).zip","ZIP","0.14","true","true","true","true","true","false","true","true","covers/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 2 (Japan).png","miximages/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 2 (Japan).png","screenshots/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 2 (Japan).png","titlescreens/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 2 (Japan).png","3dboxes/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 2 (Japan).png","","marquees/nes/Karaoke Studio Senyou Cassette Vol. 2 (Japan).png"
