"nes_ms-pac-man-namco","Ms. Pac-Man (Namco)","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1993-11-01","1993","1990s","Now Production","Namco","Action / Labyrinth","Action","1-2","1","2","80","4","In 1982, a sequel to the  incredibly popular Pac-Man was introduced in the form of his girlfriend, Ms. Pac-Man.  This sequel continued on the ""eat the dots/avoid the ghosts"" gameplay of the original game, but added new features to keep the title fresh.

