Survive a few rounds of gameplay, and the player will be treated to humorous intermissions showing the growing romantic relationship between Pac-Man and Ms. Pac-Man, leading all the way up to the arrival of ""Junior"".","Ms. Pac-Man (USA) (Tengen) (Unl).zip","ZIP","0.02","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/nes/Ms. Pac-Man (USA) (Tengen) (Unl).png","miximages/nes/Ms. Pac-Man (USA) (Tengen) (Unl).png","screenshots/nes/Ms. Pac-Man (USA) (Tengen) (Unl).png","titlescreens/nes/Ms. Pac-Man (USA) (Tengen) (Unl).png","3dboxes/nes/Ms. Pac-Man (USA) (Tengen) (Unl).png","backcovers/nes/Ms. Pac-Man (USA) (Tengen) (Unl).png","marquees/nes/Ms. Pac-Man (USA) (Tengen) (Unl).png"
