"nes_nigel-mansell-s-world-championship","Nigel Mansell's World Championship","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1993-01-01","1993","1990s","Gremlin Graphics Software","Gremlin Graphics Software","Racing, Driving","Racing","1","1","1","60","3","Timing smiled on Gremlin with this licensed Formula 1 simulation, as Nigel's long quest for a championship had finally come good. The game was pitched somewhere in between a full-blown simulation like F1 GP and action games like Continental Circus. Only 12 cars were in each race, which could last from between 3 and 20 laps.

