"nes_operation-wolf","Operation Wolf","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1992-01-01","1992","1990s","Taito","Taito","Shooter / FPV","Shooter","1","1","1","70","3.5","You have been recruited for Operation Wolf, a desperate attempt to rescue prisoners from the enemy. Through a series of missions, you'll engage a variety of enemies, from soldiers to ninjas, patrol boats to helicopters, and more. 
