"nes_sd-battle-oozumou-heisei-hero-basho","Sd Battle Oozumou - Heisei Hero Basho","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1990-04-20","1990","1990s","Unknown","Banpresto","Sports / Sumo","Sports","1-2","1","2","","","SD Battle Oozumo: Heisei Hero Basho (1990) is the first game in Banpresto's Compati Hero series for the Famicom. Initially a sumo game, the series expanded into various crossover titles and even influenced the Super Robot Wars series. The games typically involve SD heroes facing off against a combined greater evil and sometimes refer to the characters as Gachapon figures.

