"nes_tantei-jinguuji-saburou-yokohamakou-renzoku-satsujin-jiken","Tantei Jinguuji Saburou - Yokohamakou Renzoku Satsujin Jiken","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1988-02-26","1988","1980s","Data East","Data East","Adventure","Adventure","1","1","1","","","The player takes on the role of Saburou Jinguuji, a private detective investigating a series of mysterious murders in the city of Yokohama. Gameplay involves exploring different locations, interacting with non-player characters (NPCs), collecting clues and solving puzzles that lead to the discovery of the culprit.
The game uses a dialogue system where the player can ask questions and choose different answer options, influencing the course of the investigation.
The player will need to gather evidence to solve the mystery, with various characters with different backgrounds and motivations providing valuable clues. The narrative is linear but immersive, with elements of suspense.","Tantei Jinguuji Saburou - Yokohamakou Renzoku Satsujin Jiken (Japan).zip","ZIP","0.1","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/nes/Tantei Jinguuji Saburou - Yokohamakou Renzoku Satsujin Jiken (Japan).png","miximages/nes/Tantei Jinguuji Saburou - Yokohamakou Renzoku Satsujin Jiken (Japan).png","screenshots/nes/Tantei Jinguuji Saburou - Yokohamakou Renzoku Satsujin Jiken (Japan).png","titlescreens/nes/Tantei Jinguuji Saburou - Yokohamakou Renzoku Satsujin Jiken (Japan).png","3dboxes/nes/Tantei Jinguuji Saburou - Yokohamakou Renzoku Satsujin Jiken (Japan).png","backcovers/nes/Tantei Jinguuji Saburou - Yokohamakou Renzoku Satsujin Jiken (Japan).png","marquees/nes/Tantei Jinguuji Saburou - Yokohamakou Renzoku Satsujin Jiken (Japan).png"
