"nes_the-terminator","The Terminator","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1993-01-01","1993","1990s","Radical Entertainment","Mindscape","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","70","3.5","The Terminator loosely follows the plot of the 1984 Arnold Schwarzenegger film. The game begins in the future, where the hero Kyle Reese must battle through a post-apocalyptic future in order to go back in time to 1984 Los Angeles. Once there, he must progress through various checkpoints as outlined by the main movie plot: Find Sarah Connor, shootout at the police station, and the climax in the factory. The main levels of the game consist of side-scrolling jumping and shooting action. In between levels are car chases where the Terminator attempts to run you down as you race to your next destination.","Terminator, The (USA, Europe).zip","ZIP","0.13","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/nes/Terminator, The (USA, Europe).png","miximages/nes/Terminator, The (USA, Europe).png","screenshots/nes/Terminator, The (USA, Europe).png","titlescreens/nes/Terminator, The (USA, Europe).png","3dboxes/nes/Terminator, The (USA, Europe).png","backcovers/nes/Terminator, The (USA, Europe).png","marquees/nes/Terminator, The (USA, Europe).png"
