Sequences in the film are also replicated more tightly than in the PC versions. Quaid will be chased by henchman Richter in the first level, and must battle his wife inside their apartment. The security x-ray scanner takes up a level, as does the subway battle after. The player will also commandeer a Martian taxi for a driving level inside the colony, and windows can be shot out on Mars, sucking out any unfortunate baddies nearby.","Total Recall (USA).zip","ZIP","0.1","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/nes/Total Recall (USA).png","miximages/nes/Total Recall (USA).png","screenshots/nes/Total Recall (USA).png","titlescreens/nes/Total Recall (USA).png","3dboxes/nes/Total Recall (USA).png","backcovers/nes/Total Recall (USA).png","marquees/nes/Total Recall (USA).png"
