"nes_xenophobe","Xenophobe","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1989-12-01","1989","1980s","Sunsoft","Sunsoft","Platform / Shooter Scrolling","Shooter","1-2","1","2","40","2","Xenos.  The very name strikes fear into every colonist's heart.  A distress call is received from space stations orbiting your homeworld, then silence.  A single ship escapes, piloted by a battered man who tells the tale of pods that hatch into acid-spitting Xenos.

