"nes_mario-amp-yoshi","Mario &amp; Yoshi","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1992-12-20","1992","1990s","Game Freak","Nintendo","Puzzle","Puzzle","1-2","1","2","80","4","An airborne puzzle invasion! It's raining Goombas, Bloobers and Boo Buddies! You have to help Mario cope with the airborne invasion! As the critters fall, catch them on trays. Switch and shuffle to save the day! Stack two of a kind and they both disappear. Or, capture the whole bunch in-between egg shells. When the egg shells match, out hatches Yoshi and up goes your score! The action heats up as the characters fall faster and faster. If your piles get too high, the game is over. Choose your difficulty level and play for a high score or challenge a friend in a head-to-head hatch-off! If you like Dr. Mario, but you're ready for a whole new kind of challenge, you'll love this quick-shuffle action puzzle game!","Yoshi (USA).zip","ZIP","0.04","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/nes/Yoshi (USA).png","miximages/nes/Yoshi (USA).png","screenshots/nes/Yoshi (USA).png","titlescreens/nes/Yoshi (USA).png","3dboxes/nes/Yoshi (USA).png","backcovers/nes/Yoshi (USA).png","marquees/nes/Yoshi (USA).png"
"nes_yoshi-s-cookie","Yoshi's Cookie","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1994-04-28","1994","1990s","TOSE","Nintendo","Strategy","Strategy / Sim","1-2","1","2","70","3.5","Yoshi's Cookie is a fast-paced puzzle game that can be enjoyed by everyone as it is easy to play, but challenging to complete. To play, you move the randomly placed cookies into rows and columns of cookies with similar patterns. When you successfully assemble a row or column of the same cookies, the line will disappear, and you can begin on a new row or column. The ""Yoshi"" cookie is very special in both the 1-player and the 2-player game. Since the Yoshi Cookie is the key to both games, you must use it wisely.","Yoshi's Cookie (USA).zip","ZIP","0.07","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/nes/Yoshi's Cookie (USA).png","miximages/nes/Yoshi's Cookie (USA).png","screenshots/nes/Yoshi's Cookie (USA).png","titlescreens/nes/Yoshi's Cookie (USA).png","3dboxes/nes/Yoshi's Cookie (USA).png","backcovers/nes/Yoshi's Cookie (USA).png","marquees/nes/Yoshi's Cookie (USA).png"
"nes_youkai-club","Youkai Club","nes","Nintendo Entertainment System (NES) / Famicom","NES","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit)","1987-05-19","1987","1980s","TOSE","Jaleco","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","","","This is an extremely hard action platform type game. This game is mostly similar to other Mario Bros run and jump variants we are familiar with. This game however, throws in a bit of a Castlevania type theme. You mostly travel upward and not side to side like most similar side scrolling games. This contributes to making the game more difficult than the others. It also has a added twist that you have to work your way around obstacles, lines of fire that come out the floor, and many other things. You collect keys, bombs, and other items of which I am not sure where you use them because I didn't make it that far. All in all it is a fun game, though a very challenging one.","Youkai Club (Japan).zip","ZIP","0.07","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/nes/Youkai Club (Japan).png","miximages/nes/Youkai Club (Japan).png","screenshots/nes/Youkai Club (Japan).png","titlescreens/nes/Youkai Club (Japan).png","3dboxes/nes/Youkai Club (Japan).png","backcovers/nes/Youkai Club (Japan).png","marquees/nes/Youkai Club (Japan).png"
