"fds_akumajou-dracula","Akumajou Dracula","fds","Famicom Disk System","FDS","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit viðbót)","1986-09-26","1986","1980s","Konami","Konami","Platform / Fighter Scrolling","Platformer","1","1","1","","","Transylvania enjoyed a century of peace thanks to the legendary hero, Christopher Belmont, a vampire hunter who vanquished Count Dracula one hundred years earlier with a holy whip named Vampire Killer. While the Easter celebration carried on with a grand carnival, evil men gathered in a monastery at the edge of the village and conducted a black mass to resurrect Count Dracula.

