"fds_michael-english-daibouken","Michael English Daibouken","fds","Famicom Disk System","FDS","Nintendo","3. kynslóð (8-bit viðbót)","1987-06-19","1987","1980s","Scorpion Soft","Scorpion Soft","Educational","Action","1","1","1","","","Michael English Daibouken (lit: ""Michael's English Grand Adventure"") is an educational game where the character of Michael, an orange cat, teaches kittens the various letters in the English language as well as some English vocabulary. Michael has to catch floating letters in order to spell out English words, while avoiding the incorrect letters. The game has various different backdrops, including space.

