As a game, Tama and Friends is very basic, and quite clearly meant for very young children. The goal is to simply walk right across a suburban environment while avoiding enemies like birds and random flying junk. Tama can also climb telegraph poles to help him get higher, which occasionally lead to bonus areas, and there are also bosses to be fought at the end of certain stages.","Tama &amp; Friends - Sanchoume Daibouken (Japan).zip","ZIP","0","false","false","false","false","false","false","false","false","","","","","","",""
