"gb_nba-all-star-challenge","Nba All Star Challenge","gb","Nintendo Game Boy","Game Boy","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (8-bit Handheld)","1992-01-01","1992","1990s","Beam Software","Flying Edge","Sports / Basketball","Sports","1-2","1","2","60","3","NBA All-Star Challenge offers one-on-one basketball featuring NBA players from the 1991-1992 season. Five different playing modes are available: a single one-on-one match, a free throw competition, a 3 point shootout, a H.O.R.S.E. competition and a one-on-one tournament.
