"megadrive_the-addams-family","The Addams Family","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-01-01","1993","1990s","Ocean","Flying Edge","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","70","3.5","The Addams Family is a platform game based on the characters and settings from the movie (which, in turn, is based on the famous 1960's television series, which in turn is based on Charles Addams cartoon of the same name, which was featured in the magazine, The New Yorker, in the 30's).

