"megadrive_xin-qi-gai-wang-zi","Xin Qi Gai Wang Zi","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","","","","Computer &amp; Entertainment","C&amp;E","Role Playing Game","RPG","1","1","1","70","3.5","Xin Qigai Wangzi is a Chinese-made RPG loosely based on the famous novel by Mark Twain, Prince and the Pauper. A young prince is bored with the life in the palace, and one day manages to go outside the gate, distracting the guards. In the town he meets a young boy who looks very similar to him. The prince offers him to switch their clothes, because he wants to spend the day as an ordinary boy. But when he comes back to the palace, the guards don't recognize him in his beggar's clothes and refuse to let him in. A new life, full of danger and adventures, begins for the young prince...","Beggar Prince (USA, Europe) (Rev 1) (Super Fighter Team) (Unl).7z","7Z","1.65","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Beggar Prince (USA, Europe) (Rev 1) (Super Fighter Team) (Unl).png","miximages/megadrive/Beggar Prince (USA, Europe) (Rev 1) (Super Fighter Team) (Unl).png","screenshots/megadrive/Beggar Prince (USA, Europe) (Rev 1) (Super Fighter Team) (Unl).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Beggar Prince (USA, Europe) (Rev 1) (Super Fighter Team) (Unl).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Beggar Prince (USA, Europe) (Rev 1) (Super Fighter Team) (Unl).png","backcovers/megadrive/Beggar Prince (USA, Europe) (Rev 1) (Super Fighter Team) (Unl).png","marquees/megadrive/Beggar Prince (USA, Europe) (Rev 1) (Super Fighter Team) (Unl).png"
