"megadrive_the-berenstain-bears-camping-adventure","The Berenstain Bears' Camping Adventure","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-01-01","1994","1990s","Realtime Associates","SEGA","Platform","Platformer","1-2","1","2","50","2.5","A bear family - Father Bear, Mother Bear, Sister Bear, and Brother Bear - decide to go camping to the nearby forest. While they sit by the fire, the two cubs decide to explore the area. Visit dangerous places, avoid or destroy the enemies, and collect things that bears like most - such as honey or fresh fish!

