"megadrive_brutal-paws-of-fury","Brutal : Paws of Fury","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-01-01","1994","1990s","Imagitec Design","GameTek","Fighting","Fighting","1-2","1","2","60","3","In a humorous twist, the Dalai Llama hosts a martial arts tournament on his island featuring animal competitors of all species, with players stepping into the ring to challenge various furry foes before facing the Llama himself.

Brutal: Paws of Fury plays as a classic 1-on-1 fighting game set across diverse environments where you progress through a series of duels. Combat involves punching, kicking, executing special moves or using a taunt to recover a small amount of health.

Each match consists of various rounds and the first fighter to win the required number of rounds takes the bout. A loss ends the game, though continues are available to try again, culminating in a unique ending animation based on your character.

Players can also fight a single duel against either the computer or a friend, selecting both the opponent and the arena. The game adopts a cute visual style.

Notably, console versions allow players to unlock new special moves after winning best-of-3 series.","Brutal - Paws of Fury (Europe) (En,Fr,De).7z","7Z","0.91","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Brutal - Paws of Fury (Europe) (En,Fr,De).png","miximages/megadrive/Brutal - Paws of Fury (Europe) (En,Fr,De).png","screenshots/megadrive/Brutal - Paws of Fury (Europe) (En,Fr,De).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Brutal - Paws of Fury (Europe) (En,Fr,De).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Brutal - Paws of Fury (Europe) (En,Fr,De).png","backcovers/megadrive/Brutal - Paws of Fury (Europe) (En,Fr,De).png","marquees/megadrive/Brutal - Paws of Fury (Europe) (En,Fr,De).png"
