"megadrive_bubsy-ii","Bubsy II","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-10-21","1994","1990s","Accolade","Accolade","Platform","Platformer","1-2","1","2","70","3.5","Bubsy is back! After defeating the evil Woolies in the first game, Bubsy, the brave bob-cat, has to participate in an even more dangerous adventure: to explore a mysterious hyperdimensional mansion, inside of which there are portals that lead to different area in different locations and times. 

