"megadrive_clue","Clue","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1992-01-01","1992","1990s","Parker Brothers","Sculptured Software","Strategy","Strategy / Sim","1-6","1","6","60","3","In addition to play by the original rules, Clue has an additional mode that allows movement via ""points."" Each turn begins with nine points and every action the player takes costs points. The player can only do as many things as he has points. For example, moving from square to square costs one point, making a suggestion costs three points. Many players prefer this mode of play as it makes the game more balanced since each player gets the same number of ""moves"" each turn.","Clue (USA).7z","7Z","0.29","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Clue (USA).png","miximages/megadrive/Clue (USA).png","screenshots/megadrive/Clue (USA).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Clue (USA).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Clue (USA).png","backcovers/megadrive/Clue (USA).png","marquees/megadrive/Clue (USA).png"
"megadrive_coach-k-college-basketball","Coach K College Basketball","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-02-01","1995","1990s","Electronic Arts","Electronic Arts","Sports / Basketball","Sports","1-4","1","4","70","3.5","Mike Krzyzewski, the lifetime coach of the Duke University basketball team, endorses this NCAA-licensed spin-off from the NBA Live engine. The game includes 32 NCAA teams (including K's own Duke Blue Devils and the 1994 NCAA Champions Arkansas Razorbacks), as well as eight classic teams, but the license does not include player names.

There are three game modes: Season, Tournament (with three save slots for both) and Exhibition, and options follow the standard set from the NBA Live series. Gameplay also remains unchanged, with the typical three basic actions (fast running/steal, pass and shoot/block for A, B and C buttons) and the ability to call moves on the fly by pressing one of the buttons along Start (three or six moves can be set, depending on the joypad used).","Coach K College Basketball (USA).7z","7Z","0.82","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Coach K College Basketball (USA).png","miximages/megadrive/Coach K College Basketball (USA).png","screenshots/megadrive/Coach K College Basketball (USA).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Coach K College Basketball (USA).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Coach K College Basketball (USA).png","backcovers/megadrive/Coach K College Basketball (USA).png","marquees/megadrive/Coach K College Basketball (USA).png"
