The game progresses linear through each page of the comic book, however secret paths and alternate routes through the story can be discovered. At the end of each level, Sketch receives a super hero rating for how well he's progressing.","Comix Zone (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es).7z","7Z","1.42","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Comix Zone (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es).png","miximages/megadrive/Comix Zone (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es).png","screenshots/megadrive/Comix Zone (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Comix Zone (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Comix Zone (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es).png","backcovers/megadrive/Comix Zone (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es).png","marquees/megadrive/Comix Zone (Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es).png"
