"megadrive_cutie-suzuki-no-ringside-angel","Cutie Suzuki No Ringside Angel","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1990-12-12","1990","1990s","Copya System","Asmik","Sports / Fighting","Sports","1-2","1","2","40","2","""Cutie Suzuki no Ringside Angel"" is a wrestling game in which you can choose to play as one of the nine female wrestlers available. Each girl has her own strengths and weaknesses. There are three modes in the game: you can fight against any of the opponents with the character you have chosen; you can participate in a playoff tournament; and there is an additional ""watch"" mode in which you can simply watch the fights without participating. Beside the traditional moves, the wrestling style of the girls allows punching the opponents.","Cutie Suzuki no Ringside Angel (Japan).7z","7Z","0.25","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Cutie Suzuki no Ringside Angel (Japan).png","miximages/megadrive/Cutie Suzuki no Ringside Angel (Japan).png","screenshots/megadrive/Cutie Suzuki no Ringside Angel (Japan).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Cutie Suzuki no Ringside Angel (Japan).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Cutie Suzuki no Ringside Angel (Japan).png","backcovers/megadrive/Cutie Suzuki no Ringside Angel (Japan).png","marquees/megadrive/Cutie Suzuki no Ringside Angel (Japan).png"
"megadrive_cutthroat-island","Cutthroat Island","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-01-01","1995","1990s","Software Creations","Acclaim Entertainment","Beat'em Up","Beat 'em up","1-2","1","2","50","2.5","In this game you play the role of a pirate lady called Morgan who was given a piece of a map by her father before he died. In the game you set out to find more pieces of the map so that you can find the hidden treasure buried on Cutthroat Island. The gameplay involves you scrolling along the screen and sword fighting pirates and other scoundrels one on one with various different attacks. As you progress you unlock more combos. This game is based on the film by the same name.","CutThroat Island (USA, Europe).7z","7Z","0.68","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/CutThroat Island (USA, Europe).png","miximages/megadrive/CutThroat Island (USA, Europe).png","screenshots/megadrive/CutThroat Island (USA, Europe).png","titlescreens/megadrive/CutThroat Island (USA, Europe).png","3dboxes/megadrive/CutThroat Island (USA, Europe).png","backcovers/megadrive/CutThroat Island (USA, Europe).png","marquees/megadrive/CutThroat Island (USA, Europe).png"
