"megadrive_daffy-duck-in-hollywood","Daffy Duck in Hollywood","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-01-01","1994","1990s","SEGA","Probe Software","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","70","3.5","Yosemite Sam calls on Detective Daffy Duck to attempt to retrieve his precious golden movie awards. Mad Professor Duckbrain has stolen the awards and wants a million bucks to give them back.  Daffy Duck grabs his trusty bubble gun and must explore film sets and retrieve the awards. The themed movie worlds range from horror to western and jungle to sci-fi. Along the way Daffy can power up his bubble gun to fire different types of bubbles. Enemies are defeated by capturing them in bubbles and allowing them to float away. You can also attain the help of a fairy duckmother, who will fly around with you and protect you. The scenes are rigged with dynamite that must be deactivated before it goes BOOM!","Daffy Duck in Hollywood (Europe) (Beta) (1994-08-xx).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Daffy Duck in Hollywood (Europe) (Beta) (1994-08-xx).png","miximages/megadrive/Daffy Duck in Hollywood (Europe) (Beta) (1994-08-xx).png","screenshots/megadrive/Daffy Duck in Hollywood (Europe) (Beta) (1994-08-xx).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Daffy Duck in Hollywood (Europe) (Beta) (1994-08-xx).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Daffy Duck in Hollywood (Europe) (Beta) (1994-08-xx).png","backcovers/megadrive/Daffy Duck in Hollywood (Europe) (Beta) (1994-08-xx).png","marquees/megadrive/Daffy Duck in Hollywood (Europe) (Beta) (1994-08-xx).png"
