"megadrive_dragon-slayer-eiyuu-densetsu","Dragon Slayer - Eiyuu Densetsu","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-09-16","1994","1990s","Nihon Falcom","SEGA","Adventure","Adventure","1","1","1","80","4","Dragon Slayer: The Legend of Heroes tells the story of a young prince named Selios. One day, his old teacher Raiyas sends him to a nearby cave to retrieve a magical weapon. When the prince returns, he finds the house under attack by monsters. Raiyas tells him to seek help in the castle of a baron, whose country has long been allied with theirs. However, the baron betrays Selios' trust and imprisons him. The young prince manages to escape, but with no way back, he has no choice but to wander around the country, trying to find trustworthy companions who would help him save his country.
