"megadrive_nhl-95","NHL 95","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-10-27","1994","1990s","High Score Productions","Electronic Arts","Sports / Hockey","Sports","1-4","1","4","80","4","NHL '95 was EA Sports' third licensed ice hockey game, promising the fastest action in the series to date. The action is viewed top-down, and can be played with or without realistic penalties. There is a full season mode, allowing you to guide a team through all 84 matches, with the option of injuries potentially putting players out of a sequence of matches. You have full control over trading and creating players for your squad. New in-game moves include dummy shots and lie-down blocks.","Elitserien 95 (Sweden).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Elitserien 95 (Sweden).png","miximages/megadrive/Elitserien 95 (Sweden).png","screenshots/megadrive/Elitserien 95 (Sweden).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Elitserien 95 (Sweden).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Elitserien 95 (Sweden).png","backcovers/megadrive/Elitserien 95 (Sweden).png","marquees/megadrive/Elitserien 95 (Sweden).png"
"megadrive_nhl-96","NHL 96","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-01-01","1995","1990s","High Score Productions","Electronic Arts","Sports / Hockey","Sports","1-4","1","4","60","3","NHL 96 was the first EA Sports game to feature Virtual Stadium technology, which resulted in a 3D feel and multiple camera angles. The NHL license ensures that real teams and players of the era are included, with a full league and playoff system. Many game options can be toggled - the infamous fighting is option, as are the penalties and offsides. The control system makes it possible to execute one-touch passes, and several special trick moves to quickly advance the ball. As a bonus feature, it included 'Hockey Card' profiles of every player on CD, and interviews with the stars of the game.","Elitserien 96 (Sweden).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Elitserien 96 (Sweden).png","miximages/megadrive/Elitserien 96 (Sweden).png","screenshots/megadrive/Elitserien 96 (Sweden).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Elitserien 96 (Sweden).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Elitserien 96 (Sweden).png","backcovers/megadrive/Elitserien 96 (Sweden).png","marquees/megadrive/Elitserien 96 (Sweden).png"
"megadrive_empire-of-steel","Empire of Steel","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1992-06-01","1992","1990s","Flying Edge","Hot-B","Shoot'em Up / Horizontal","Shooter","1","1","1","90","4.5","The game presents itself as an old-time war film produced by the ""HOT-B Film Corporation"". In the film, the future is the Steel Age, where a military dictatorship called Motorhead enslaved the human population. The only hope for freedom is the Republic of Silverhead, who managed to remain independent, and who alone has the weapons to take out Motorhead.","Empire of Steel (Europe).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Empire of Steel (Europe).png","miximages/megadrive/Empire of Steel (Europe).png","screenshots/megadrive/Empire of Steel (Europe).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Empire of Steel (Europe).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Empire of Steel (Europe).png","backcovers/megadrive/Empire of Steel (Europe).png","marquees/megadrive/Empire of Steel (Europe).png"
"megadrive_taz-in-escape-from-mars","Taz in Escape from Mars","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-09-01","1994","1990s","SEGA","SEGA","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","70","3.5","You play as Taz, the famous cartoon-character. Taz is captured by Marvin the Martian and transfered to his intergalactic Zoo! Now it is your job to aid Taz in his great escape from the Zoo-prison and also find a way back home to Earth. To make the escape a little easier, there are items placed here and there, such as cakes which make regain your health. You also find gas tanks, which you can eat and then breath fire.

