"megadrive_evander-real-deal-holyfield-s-boxing","Evander 'Real Deal' Holyfield's Boxing","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1992-09-24","1992","1990s","Acme Animation","SEGA","Sports / Boxing","Sports","1-2","1","2","80","4","“Evander Holyfield's 'Real Deal' Boxing” is a boxing simulation where Holyfield is the only licensed fighter, while the other competitors are fictional. The game emphasizes a strategic approach and features a pseudo-3D side view with a dynamic background. Players can either engage in a quick exhibition match or climb the ranks of 30 opponents in career mode with a custom-created boxer, ultimately facing Holyfield. The character creation allows customization of attributes such as skin color, hairstyle, dominant hand, and focus on specific skills. In career mode, players can enhance their boxer's stats through targeted training.","Evander Holyfield's 'Real Deal' Boxing (World).7z","7Z","0.31","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Evander Holyfield's 'Real Deal' Boxing (World).png","miximages/megadrive/Evander Holyfield's 'Real Deal' Boxing (World).png","screenshots/megadrive/Evander Holyfield's 'Real Deal' Boxing (World).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Evander Holyfield's 'Real Deal' Boxing (World).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Evander Holyfield's 'Real Deal' Boxing (World).png","backcovers/megadrive/Evander Holyfield's 'Real Deal' Boxing (World).png","marquees/megadrive/Evander Holyfield's 'Real Deal' Boxing (World).png"
