"megadrive_exo-squad","Exo Squad","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-01-01","1995","1990s","Playmates Interactive","Virgin","Platform / Shooter Scrolling","Shooter","1-2","1","2","","","Based on the American animated television series of the same name that ran between 1993 and 1994, this game puts the player in the mecha-like Exo-Frames of three pilots: Lt. J.T. Marsh, Sgt. Rita Torres, and Wolf Bronksy. Each pilot's levels have a distinct mechanic, ranging from After Burner-esque behind the shoulder fight action, to platforming, and side-scrolling beat-em-up gameplay.","Exo Squad (Europe).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Exo Squad (Europe).png","miximages/megadrive/Exo Squad (Europe).png","screenshots/megadrive/Exo Squad (Europe).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Exo Squad (Europe).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Exo Squad (Europe).png","backcovers/megadrive/Exo Squad (Europe).png","marquees/megadrive/Exo Squad (Europe).png"
