"megadrive_exodus-journey-to-the-promised-land","Exodus : Journey to the Promised Land","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-01-01","1993","1990s","Wisdom Tree","Wisdom Tree","Puzzle","Puzzle","1-2","1","2","90","4.5","In Exodus you need to guide Moses through 100 different levels in order to reach the promised land. The gameplay features an action/strategy part similar to Boulder Dash, and a question part. In the action part, you need to collect five question marks and enough Manna to open the exit of the maze-like screens. There are a variety of boulders, walls, dirt, and other obstacles in the way. Some obstacles can be destroyed when moses uses his staff to say the word of god, other obstacles can be pushed out of the way, and some you must find a way around. You need to be careful when navigating around the screens, if you cause any boulders to fall and they land on you a life is lost. Also wandering about are a variety of enemies which can be destroyed or avoided, but will cost you one life if you get caught. When you find all the question marks and manna you need, the exit appears and you can move on to the question phase.","Exodus - Journey to the Promised Land (USA) (Unl).7z","7Z","0.36","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Exodus - Journey to the Promised Land (USA) (Unl).png","miximages/megadrive/Exodus - Journey to the Promised Land (USA) (Unl).png","screenshots/megadrive/Exodus - Journey to the Promised Land (USA) (Unl).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Exodus - Journey to the Promised Land (USA) (Unl).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Exodus - Journey to the Promised Land (USA) (Unl).png","backcovers/megadrive/Exodus - Journey to the Promised Land (USA) (Unl).png","marquees/megadrive/Exodus - Journey to the Promised Land (USA) (Unl).png"
"megadrive_ferrari-grand-prix-challenge","Ferrari Grand Prix Challenge","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1992-09-01","1992","1990s","Aisystem Tokyo","Flying Edge","Racing, Driving","Racing","1-2","1","2","60","3","Ferrari Grand Prix Challenge puts you behind the wheel in a first-person racing sim spanning a full F1 season with qualifying and races across 20 tracks, including all 16 from 1992. In Grand Prix mode, you're limited to one of the four weakest teams, with weather randomized. In Time Attack, you can race as top teams like McLaren or Williams, customize weather, and go for lap records. Car setup can be adjusted before races, and the blend of cockpit view and strategic tuning delivers an immersive racing experience.","F-1 Hero MD (China) (Ja) (Pirate).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/F-1 Hero MD (China) (Ja) (Pirate).png","miximages/megadrive/F-1 Hero MD (China) (Ja) (Pirate).png","screenshots/megadrive/F-1 Hero MD (China) (Ja) (Pirate).png","titlescreens/megadrive/F-1 Hero MD (China) (Ja) (Pirate).png","3dboxes/megadrive/F-1 Hero MD (China) (Ja) (Pirate).png","backcovers/megadrive/F-1 Hero MD (China) (Ja) (Pirate).png","marquees/megadrive/F-1 Hero MD (China) (Ja) (Pirate).png"
"megadrive_f-117-night-storm","F-117 Night Storm","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-12-23","1993","1990s","Electronic Arts","Electronic Arts","Simulation","Strategy / Sim","1","1","1","70","3.5","This game allows the player to take control of an F-117A Stealth Fighter. The game is broken down into either an arcade or campaign mode.

In the arcade mode, the player can decide the number of enemy air and ground units, the environment, length of mission, and the difficulty level. This mode allows the player to hone their skills in order to prepare for the campaign mode. 

The campaign mode is the main part of the game and contains 30 missions. The game includes nine theaters of combat such as training missions in the Nevada Desert, to the conflict in Panama, and also to the Gulf War. Each mission has a primary object that must be destroyed in order to advance to the next mission.","F-117 Night Storm (USA, Europe).7z","7Z","0.91","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/F-117 Night Storm (USA, Europe).png","miximages/megadrive/F-117 Night Storm (USA, Europe).png","screenshots/megadrive/F-117 Night Storm (USA, Europe).png","titlescreens/megadrive/F-117 Night Storm (USA, Europe).png","3dboxes/megadrive/F-117 Night Storm (USA, Europe).png","backcovers/megadrive/F-117 Night Storm (USA, Europe).png","marquees/megadrive/F-117 Night Storm (USA, Europe).png"
