"megadrive_garry-kitchen-s-super-battletank-war-in-the-gulf","Garry Kitchen's Super Battletank : War in the Gulf","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1992-01-01","1992","1990s","Absolute Entertainment","Absolute Entertainment","Shooter / Vehicle, FPV","Shooter","1","1","1","70","3.5","Super Battletank 2 is the second installment of Garry Kitchen's Battletank series on Megadrive. Driving a tank, you have several missions to carry out in conflicts of the 90s. You control the speed and the direction that the tank will take, as well as the sight of the barrel and the submachine guns. Looking at the map, you will know where the enemies are, and how to get around dangerous minefields, even for such a solid vehicle.","Garry Kitchen's Super Battletank - War in the Gulf (USA).7z","7Z","0.25","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Garry Kitchen's Super Battletank - War in the Gulf (USA).png","miximages/megadrive/Garry Kitchen's Super Battletank - War in the Gulf (USA).png","screenshots/megadrive/Garry Kitchen's Super Battletank - War in the Gulf (USA).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Garry Kitchen's Super Battletank - War in the Gulf (USA).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Garry Kitchen's Super Battletank - War in the Gulf (USA).png","backcovers/megadrive/Garry Kitchen's Super Battletank - War in the Gulf (USA).png","marquees/megadrive/Garry Kitchen's Super Battletank - War in the Gulf (USA).png"
"megadrive_gauntlet-iv","Gauntlet IV","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-09-17","1993","1990s","Tengen","M2TO","Action / Labyrinth","Action","1-4","1","4","70","3.5","This port of the arcade original has some extra modes available. Choose again from Thor the Warrior,  Thyra the Valkyrie,  Merlin the Wizard and Questor the Elf (each with their own advantages/disadvantages) and 1 to 4 players(supports Sega's four-player adapter).

Alongside the standard arcade mode, there are the Quest, Battle and Record modes.
