"megadrive_home-alone-2-lost-in-new-york","Home Alone 2 : Lost in New York","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-01-01","1993","1990s","Interactive Designs","SEGA","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","50","2.5","The McCallister family is off to Miami for a Christmas vacation in the sun. The son, Kevin, ends up on the wrong plane and winds up in New York City all by himself. The two-man bandit team he helped catch in the first film also just so happen to be there, and are out for revenge.

