"megadrive_hyokkori-hyoutanjima-daitouryou-wo-mezase","Hyokkori Hyoutanjima - Daitouryou Wo Mezase!","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1992-08-07","1992","1990s","JSH","SEGA","Strategy","Strategy / Sim","1-4","1","4","40","2","Hyokkori Hyotanjima: Daitoryo o Mezase! (""Aim for the Presidency!"") is a sugoroku-style board game for up to four players based on the popular NHK children's show Hyokkori Hyotanjima. Four characters from the show all decide they want to be the island's president, and so they set off to start campaigning.

