"megadrive_castle-of-illusion-starring-mickey-mouse","Castle of Illusion Starring Mickey Mouse","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1990-11-22","1990","1990s","SEGA","SEGA","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","80","4","This is the first Mickey Mouse game for Sega consoles. In this game the famous Disney character must face the dangers of weird fantasy lands such as an enchanted forest and a toy world. Mickey must rescue his girlfriend Minnie who's been kidnapped by the evil witch Mizrabel.

