"megadrive_james-pond-underwater-agent","James Pond : Underwater Agent","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1991-04-01","1991","1990s","Electronic Arts","Electronic Arts","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","40","2","""James Pond"" is (obviously) a parody on the famous agent 007 stories. You control Pond, a fish-like creature, who has to complete several missions, while making his way through levels full of dangers and hostile creatures. It is not a typical ""jump and run"" game: instead of breezing through large levels, Pond has to complete unique missions for each game area: free hostages, detonate a structure, find keys, etc. It is possible to exit a level only after having completed the objective. Many missions are timed.","James Pond - Underwater Agent (USA, Europe).7z","7Z","0.16","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/James Pond - Underwater Agent (USA, Europe).png","miximages/megadrive/James Pond - Underwater Agent (USA, Europe).png","screenshots/megadrive/James Pond - Underwater Agent (USA, Europe).png","titlescreens/megadrive/James Pond - Underwater Agent (USA, Europe).png","3dboxes/megadrive/James Pond - Underwater Agent (USA, Europe).png","backcovers/megadrive/James Pond - Underwater Agent (USA, Europe).png","marquees/megadrive/James Pond - Underwater Agent (USA, Europe).png"
