"megadrive_james-pond-ii-codename-robocod","James Pond II : Codename, Robocod","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1991-01-01","1991","1990s","Vectordean","Electronic Arts","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","80","4","In his second adventure James Pond must retrieve the toys Dr Maybe has stolen. Pond has been armed with an Inspector Gadget-style stretch device, which he can use to view higher areas or claw onto ceilings so as to slide across them.

