"megadrive_janou-touryuumon","Janou Touryuumon","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-11-05","1993","1990s","Game Arts","SEGA","Asiatic board game","Board / Casual","1","1","1","70","3.5","Janou Touryuumon is another digital version of the popular Chinese board game mahjong, with the difference that it has an official license from the Japan Professional Mahjong Association. The game only has the option to play against the computer, but it has a good variety of modes to play in, such as Practice, Tournament and a mode called Skill Test, which, as its name implies, tests the level of your skills in the game.","Janou Touryuumon (Japan).7z","7Z","0.22","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/megadrive/Janou Touryuumon (Japan).png","miximages/megadrive/Janou Touryuumon (Japan).png","screenshots/megadrive/Janou Touryuumon (Japan).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Janou Touryuumon (Japan).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Janou Touryuumon (Japan).png","backcovers/megadrive/Janou Touryuumon (Japan).png","marquees/megadrive/Janou Touryuumon (Japan).png"
"megadrive_jantei-monogatari","Jantei Monogatari","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1991-03-29","1991","1990s","Atlus","Renovation Products","Strategy","Strategy / Sim","1","1","1","60","3","A daughter of the chair of a local high school, Yu Honjo, has been kidnapped by someone unknown. Unable to go to the police, the girl's sister, Mai, hires a private investigator to find out what happened to her. The only piece of evidence is a photograph from the night of Yu's disappearance, where the missing girl and three other students from the same school are playing a game of mahjong.

Jantei Monogatari is a hybrid of a traditional-style Japanese adventure game and a regular mahjong game. The player takes the role of the unnamed private investigator, and moves from place to place via menus, talking to different characters. The investigation happens through playing mahjong with each suspect: win and they'll tell you a bit more of what they know. At first, the investigator can only speak with the three girls in the photo, but as he wins games of mahjong against them, he gains information and experience that allow him to find new clues and talk to more suspects. The investigator will need to play against a dozen different opponents in his attempt to find out what happened to the kidnapped girl.","Jantei Monogatari (Japan).7z","7Z","0.89","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Jantei Monogatari (Japan).png","miximages/megadrive/Jantei Monogatari (Japan).png","screenshots/megadrive/Jantei Monogatari (Japan).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Jantei Monogatari (Japan).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Jantei Monogatari (Japan).png","backcovers/megadrive/Jantei Monogatari (Japan).png","marquees/megadrive/Jantei Monogatari (Japan).png"
"megadrive_risky-woods","Risky Woods","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1992-12-14","1992","1990s","Dinamic Software","Electronic Arts","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","60","3","Unusually for Electronic Arts in the early 90s, this was a platform -shooter game with little or no adventuring or strategy elements. The game scrolls sideways, and has sections where precision jumps are required, either to clear rivers or collect bonuses. You carry a dagger to deal with the enemies, and must avoid contact with them. When killed, they leave coins to be collected - these are spent in the shop sections. Death loses you most of your coins, but they can usually be retrieved if they land on solid ground - making it better to be killed in combat than by drowning.","Jashin Draxos (Japan, Korea) (En).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Jashin Draxos (Japan, Korea) (En).png","miximages/megadrive/Jashin Draxos (Japan, Korea) (En).png","screenshots/megadrive/Jashin Draxos (Japan, Korea) (En).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Jashin Draxos (Japan, Korea) (En).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Jashin Draxos (Japan, Korea) (En).png","backcovers/megadrive/Jashin Draxos (Japan, Korea) (En).png","marquees/megadrive/Jashin Draxos (Japan, Korea) (En).png"
