"megadrive_kid-chameleon","Kid Chameleon","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1992-05-01","1992","1990s","SEGA","SEGA","Platform","Platformer","1-2","1","2","80","4","Kid Chameleon is a side-scrolling platform game in which the main character has entered a virtual reality game called ""Wild Side"" to free the other kids inside that have been captured (*cuckoo*). He can change his shape into various other forms (hence the ""Chameleon""). This gives him special abilities which must be used to pass each of the game's 100+ stages.

