"megadrive_landstalker-the-treasures-of-king-nole","Landstalker : The Treasures of King Nole","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-10-01","1993","1990s","Climax","SEGA","Role Playing Game","RPG","1","1","1","90","4.5","A jovial fantasy yarn, Landstalker is the title that put Climax Entertainment on the map.  Following the exploits of elvish treasure hunter, Nigel, and his pixie friend, Friday, they travel to a distant island to find the long lost treasure of King Nole.

