"megadrive_metal-fangs","Metal Fangs","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-12-17","1993","1990s","Victor Interactive Software","SEGA","Racing, Driving","Racing","1","1","1","","","Metal Fangs is a unique futuristic battle driving game, where the player controls a team of racers and must attempt to destroy the competing team.

Each race is made up of 2 heats of 2 parts each, and hits or kills on the other team earns points. During each heat, each team takes one turn attacking (4 vehicles on the course) and one turn defending (3 vehicles on the course). The team with the most points at the end of the last heat wins a reward and proceeds to the next match.

Fortunately, you can upgrade your team equipment: Engines, fuel, AI, armor and weapons.

During the game, you can switch freely between each member of your team. Your vehicle automatically moves forward around the track but you can turn, throttle and brake in order to move closer to or escape from the other team.

