"megadrive_micro-machines-military","Micro Machines : Military","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1996-10-01","1996","1990s","Supersonic Software","Codemasters","Racing, Driving","Racing","1-8","1","8","90","4.5","This entry in the Micro Machines series flirts with a military theme. Using a top-down view, you race on different scaled-down tracks such as a pond, a kitchen table, a workbench, in the garden, .... The theme is reflected in the vehicles (helicopters, speedboats, tanks, supply trucks...), as well as in the music.

Up to 16 players can participate through the hot-seat party mode, but 8 racers can race simultaneously using the J-Cart and by sharing a part of the joypad. There are different game types, such as regular races (challenges), time trials, and battle arenas, in which you have to survive for a set amount of time while enemy vehicles charge. Other players can be shot to slow them down.","Micro Machines - Military (Europe) (Beta).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Micro Machines - Military (Europe) (Beta).png","miximages/megadrive/Micro Machines - Military (Europe) (Beta).png","screenshots/megadrive/Micro Machines - Military (Europe) (Beta).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Micro Machines - Military (Europe) (Beta).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Micro Machines - Military (Europe) (Beta).png","backcovers/megadrive/Micro Machines - Military (Europe) (Beta).png","marquees/megadrive/Micro Machines - Military (Europe) (Beta).png"
