"megadrive_micro-machines-turbo-tournament-96","Micro Machines : Turbo Tournament 96","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-07-01","1995","1990s","Supersonic Software","Codemasters","Racing, Driving","Racing","1-8","1","8","90","4.5","Micro Machines: Turbo Tournament 96 is a sequel to Micro Machines 2 and although the gameplay and the typical top-down view still remain the same, this fun racing game offers a great number of new features.

