"megadrive_mighty-morphin-power-rangers","Mighty Morphin Power Rangers","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-01-01","1994","1990s","Banpresto","SEGA","Beat'em Up","Beat 'em up","1-2","1","2","70","3.5","Mighty Morphin Power Rangers is a one-on-one competitive fighting game, featuring two different game modes: a Scenario Mode where the player competes against a series of CPU-controlled opponents, and a Battle Mode for two players. In the Scenario Mode, the matches consist of two segments: the player will fight against a regular-sized monster as one of the Rangers, and after the defeating the monster they will battle a giant version of it. Initially only the five original Rangers and the Megazord are available with the Green Ranger and Dragonzord being locked until they are defeated.","Mighty Morphin Power Rangers (Europe).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Mighty Morphin Power Rangers (Europe).png","miximages/megadrive/Mighty Morphin Power Rangers (Europe).png","screenshots/megadrive/Mighty Morphin Power Rangers (Europe).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Mighty Morphin Power Rangers (Europe).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Mighty Morphin Power Rangers (Europe).png","backcovers/megadrive/Mighty Morphin Power Rangers (Europe).png","marquees/megadrive/Mighty Morphin Power Rangers (Europe).png"
