"megadrive_nfl-98","NFL 98","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1997-05-14","1997","1990s","FarSight","SEGA","Sports / Football (American)","Sports","1-4","1","4","80","4","Based on the National Football League, the game was a follow up to Sega's only football video game for the Sega Saturn, NFL '97. It is the last game in Sega's original Joe Montana/NFL series, which would be succeeded by NFL 2K.

