"megadrive_nhl-97","NHL 97","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1996-10-04","1996","1990s","High Score Productions","EA Sports","Sports / Hockey","Sports","1-4","1","4","80","4","1997 edition of EA's NHL sport simulation series. Improvements in this edition come mostly in the graphical arena, with a refined version of the ""virtual stadium"" system that adds new camera angles (including the classical top-down one strangely missing from NHL 96), and polygonal players instead of the bitmap-based ones with motion-captured animations.

