"megadrive_power-monger","Power Monger","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-03-01","1993","1990s","Sprytes","Electronic Arts","Strategy","Strategy / Sim","1","1","1","80","4","Powermonger takes the basic design and concepts of Bullfrog's previous game Populous, and places it in a war context. The game cast the player as a dispossessed warlord plundering his way through 195 territories on the way to world conquest. Several other leaders have the same goal.

