"megadrive_puzzle-amp-action-tanto-r","Puzzle &amp; Action : Tanto-R","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-04-01","1994","1990s","SEGA","SEGA","Puzzle","Puzzle","1-2","1","2","80","4","Tant-R is the first entry in Sega's long-running Puzzle &amp; Action series of variety games. The game is a collection of small minigames for one to four players, such as navigating a maze, stopping a timer at the right time, or remembering a sequence of animal noises. There are a total of 20 different minigames.

