"megadrive_red-zone","Red Zone","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-11-01","1994","1990s","Time Warner Interactive","Time Warner Interactive","Shooter","Shooter","1","1","1","80","4","Red Zone is a helicopter action shooter in which you pilot an AH-64B Apache into the heart of enemy territory to thwart the plans of a nuclear armed dictator.

The dictator has begun to annex his neighbor countries so 3 special operatives are covertly sent in with a lone gunship to remove his ability to wage war.

The majority of the game consists of air-to-ground attack while flying in the Apache, using its hefty loadout of rockets, guided missiles, built-in 30 mm cannon and defensive infrared air-to-air missiles in order to eliminate the hostiles from the air, land and sea.

Fuel drums, repair kits and ammunition depletion are both factors to keep in mind and careful planning of where the pickups are located so that the chopper is able to stay in the air and able to keep fighting.

New gameplay includes the fact that as your systems get damaged, your helicopter becomes harder to control and the weapon and radar systems become affected.","Red Zone (USA, Europe).7z","7Z","0.92","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Red Zone (USA, Europe).png","miximages/megadrive/Red Zone (USA, Europe).png","screenshots/megadrive/Red Zone (USA, Europe).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Red Zone (USA, Europe).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Red Zone (USA, Europe).png","backcovers/megadrive/Red Zone (USA, Europe).png","marquees/megadrive/Red Zone (USA, Europe).png"
