"megadrive_road-rash-3","Road Rash 3","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-04-01","1995","1990s","Electronic Arts","Electronic Arts","Motorcycle race TPV","Racing","1-2","1","2","80","4","After conquering the US illegal motorcycle championship, Road Rash 3 challenges players to dominate the global circuit, racing through diverse environments ranging from the rainy streets of the UK to the neon-lit nights of Japan.

Building on its predecessors, the game introduces digitized sprites, enhanced bike upgrades like improved engines and suspension, and deadlier police tactics involving helicopters and patrol cars.

Players start with limited cash and a slow bike, earning money and better rides by finishing in the top 3 of 5 races per level to advance against tougher opponents. New weapons can stun rivals and any carried weapon persists into the next race, while each track offers unique hazards like wandering animals, icy roads or treacherous hills to master.","Road Rash 3 (USA, Europe).7z","7Z","1.02","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Road Rash 3 (USA, Europe).png","miximages/megadrive/Road Rash 3 (USA, Europe).png","screenshots/megadrive/Road Rash 3 (USA, Europe).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Road Rash 3 (USA, Europe).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Road Rash 3 (USA, Europe).png","backcovers/megadrive/Road Rash 3 (USA, Europe).png","marquees/megadrive/Road Rash 3 (USA, Europe).png"
