"megadrive_slam-shaq-vs-the-legends","Slam : Shaq vs. the Legends","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","2008-03-05","2008","2000s","High Score Productions","Electronic Arts","Sports / Basketball","Sports","1-4","1","4","","","Slam: Shaq vs. the Legends is an unreleased basketball Sega Mega Drive game which licensed the name and likeness of NBA player Shaquille O'Neal.

The game offers 3 main modes: Pick Up, Tournament and Slam. In Pick Up, players select a location and build 2 teams, filling empty slots with placeholders or special location-specific characters with the option to include pro players.

Tournaments follow a similar structure but restrict team selection to your own squad without pro players, challenging you to survive a series of matches against rival teams.

The Slam mode features a robust character editor where you can design custom players by naming them, adjusting their appearance, assigning 90 points across various abilities and choosing a hometown.

You can also customize the court style for these characters, with dunking ranges determined by their jump stats.","Slam - Shaq vs. the Legends (USA) (Proto).7z","7Z","0.76","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Slam - Shaq vs. the Legends (USA) (Proto).png","miximages/megadrive/Slam - Shaq vs. the Legends (USA) (Proto).png","screenshots/megadrive/Slam - Shaq vs. the Legends (USA) (Proto).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Slam - Shaq vs. the Legends (USA) (Proto).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Slam - Shaq vs. the Legends (USA) (Proto).png","backcovers/megadrive/Slam - Shaq vs. the Legends (USA) (Proto).png","marquees/megadrive/Slam - Shaq vs. the Legends (USA) (Proto).png"
