"megadrive_the-chaos-engine","The Chaos Engine","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-07-01","1994","1990s","The Bitmap Brothers","MicroProse","Shooter / Run and Gun","Shooter","1-2","1","2","70","3.5","Sixteen levels (in four groups of four) await you in this long-developed Bitmap Brothers title. The basic gameplay is similar to Gauntlet, but in an open air setting, with bridges across rivers and such in the maps. The visuals are in the 'metallic and blue' style the Bitmaps appeared to favor.

