"megadrive_spot-goes-to-hollywood","Spot Goes to Hollywood","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1996-01-01","1996","1990s","Virgin","Acclaim Entertainment","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","80","4","The central character in this game is Spot, the little red guy from the 7-Up TV commercials.  Spot has somehow become trapped in a movie projector.  As he jumps from film to film, he encounters many classic film genres that make up all the different levels of the game.  The main levels are a pirate movie, an adventure movie, and a horror movie, but there are many other bonus films to unlock.

