"megadrive_star-control","Star Control","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1991-01-01","1991","1990s","Toys For Bob","Ballistic","Strategy","Strategy / Sim","1-2","1","2","80","4","Star Control is a science-fiction wargame which pits the forces of the Alliance of Free Stars against those of the predatory Ur-Quan Hierarchy. The games are designed so that you can ease into play, familiarizing yourself with menus, options and player controls. 
