"megadrive_starflight","Starflight","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1991-11-01","1991","1990s","BlueSky Software","Electronic Arts","Role Playing Game","RPG","1","1","1","80","4","Long ago, a great empire of Humans, Velox, Thrynn and Elowan ruled the stars using an energy currency called Endurium, before vanishing mysteriously. A millennium later, the people of the colony World Arth have rediscovered this lost heritage through archaeological finds.

They have used these discoveries to build spaceships and form the Interstel corporation, marking their first steps back into space while facing the possibility that the same enemy that destroyed the original empire still exists.

In Starflight, players assemble a crew and customize their spaceship to explore an unknown galaxy. Using a top-down interface, they land on distant planets to gather minerals and biological data which are used to upgrade the ship and train the crew.

