"megadrive_street-racer","Street Racer","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-04-01","1995","1990s","Vivid Image","Ubi Soft Entertainment Software","Racing, Driving","Racing","1-4","1","4","80","4","Street Racer is a kart racing game similar to Super Mario Kart.

