"megadrive_streets-of-rage","Streets of Rage","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1991-10-01","1991","1990s","SEGA","SEGA","Beat'em Up","Beat 'em up","1-2","1","2","80","4","Streets of Rage is the first game in what would become a classic brawler series across the early Sega systems. Clearly inspired by the success of Capcom's Final Fight, but with innovations of its own. Choose from three different fighters, all ex-cops, and each with their own strengths, weaknesses, and moveset - then go out on the raging streets and knock some sense into the multitudes of criminal ne'er-do-wells!","Streets of Rage (World) (En,Ja).7z","7Z","0.33","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Streets of Rage (World) (En,Ja).png","miximages/megadrive/Streets of Rage (World) (En,Ja).png","screenshots/megadrive/Streets of Rage (World) (En,Ja).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Streets of Rage (World) (En,Ja).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Streets of Rage (World) (En,Ja).png","backcovers/megadrive/Streets of Rage (World) (En,Ja).png","marquees/megadrive/Streets of Rage (World) (En,Ja).png"
