"megadrive_streets-of-rage-3","Streets of Rage 3","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-06-01","1994","1990s","SEGA","SEGA","Beat'em Up","Beat 'em up","1-2","1","2","80","4","Streets of Rage 3 takes the series to the next level – faster, more complex, and more brutal than ever. With longer stages, branching storylines, and interactive environments featuring deadly traps, the game packs serious variety. New dash and dodge moves add speed, weapons break after use, and can now be integrated into combos. Team attacks return, and enemies use them too, showing smarter behavior – some even steal your health pickups! Blitz moves are now upgradeable but reset on death, though holding a button allows access at a cost. Special attacks no longer drain health but use a regenerating bar. Secret characters await those who meet hidden conditions. It's an intense street brawler with serious depth.","Streets of Rage 3 (Asia) (En).7z","7Z","1.44","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Streets of Rage 3 (Asia) (En).png","miximages/megadrive/Streets of Rage 3 (Asia) (En).png","screenshots/megadrive/Streets of Rage 3 (Asia) (En).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Streets of Rage 3 (Asia) (En).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Streets of Rage 3 (Asia) (En).png","backcovers/megadrive/Streets of Rage 3 (Asia) (En).png","marquees/megadrive/Streets of Rage 3 (Asia) (En).png"
