"megadrive_super-donkey-kong-99","Super Donkey Kong 99","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1998-01-01","1998","1990s","Gamtec","Gamtec","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","","","Super Donkey Kong 99, sometimes known as Super King Kong 99, is an unlicensed Sega Mega Drive game created by a currently unknown developer. It is an attempt to bring the likes of SNES game, Donkey Kong Country (Super Donkey Kong in Japan) to Sega's system, though is very different to any of the SNES games.
