"megadrive_teenage-mutant-hero-turtles-tournament-fighters","Teenage Mutant Hero Turtles : Tournament Fighters","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-01-01","1993","1990s","Konami","Konami","Fighting","Fighting","1-2","1","2","60","3","The game features the original 4 turtles from the previous games in the series, as well as other fighters.

