"megadrive_virtual-bart","Virtual Bart","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-01-01","1994","1990s","Sculptured Software","Acclaim Entertainment","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","50","2.5","Bart's reality goes virtual when he is strapped into Martin Prince's Virtual Reality experiment at the elementary school science fair. Each virtual reality program represents a stage in the game that Bart must play through in order to escape the machine before the programs crash.

