Laser is forward firing only but is rapid and strong, missiles can shoot back and forth and when shot from the Power Claw they will home in on enemies. Fireballs shoot in the opposite direction of your ships travel.

Unlike most other games, your ship has variable speed, which comes in handy when negotiating different kinds of obstacles and enemies.","Whip Rush - Wakusei Voltegas no Nazo (Japan).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Whip Rush - Wakusei Voltegas no Nazo (Japan).png","miximages/megadrive/Whip Rush - Wakusei Voltegas no Nazo (Japan).png","screenshots/megadrive/Whip Rush - Wakusei Voltegas no Nazo (Japan).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Whip Rush - Wakusei Voltegas no Nazo (Japan).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Whip Rush - Wakusei Voltegas no Nazo (Japan).png","backcovers/megadrive/Whip Rush - Wakusei Voltegas no Nazo (Japan).png","marquees/megadrive/Whip Rush - Wakusei Voltegas no Nazo (Japan).png"
