"megadrive_world-cup-italia-90","World Cup Italia '90","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1990-12-01","1990","1990s","SEGA","SEGA","Sports / Football (Soccer)","Sports","1-2","1","2","60","3","This soccer game lets you choose a team representing one of twenty-four countries around the world to participate in the World Championship tournament. This is identical to the real 1990 World Cup.

Once you pick your team you can also select which players you want on the field, so that you can round out the team's strengths and weaknesses. Also provided are modes for single exhibition matches, either against the computer or against a friend.

The action is viewed from above with large player sprites. Violent play is encouraged as there are no free kicks. Whereas later sports games often carry heavy focus on the attention to detail, this game is rather simplified -- you can only control the player closest to the ball, for example, and it is missing many of the rules of soccer such as penalty flags and offsides.","World Cup Italia '90 (Europe).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/World Cup Italia '90 (Europe).png","miximages/megadrive/World Cup Italia '90 (Europe).png","screenshots/megadrive/World Cup Italia '90 (Europe).png","titlescreens/megadrive/World Cup Italia '90 (Europe).png","3dboxes/megadrive/World Cup Italia '90 (Europe).png","backcovers/megadrive/World Cup Italia '90 (Europe).png","marquees/megadrive/World Cup Italia '90 (Europe).png"
"megadrive_world-cup-italia-90","World Cup Italia '90","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1990-12-01","1990","1990s","SEGA","SEGA","Sports / Football (Soccer)","Sports","1-2","1","2","60","3","This soccer game lets you choose a team representing one of twenty-four countries around the world to participate in the World Championship tournament. This is identical to the real 1990 World Cup.

Once you pick your team you can also select which players you want on the field, so that you can round out the team's strengths and weaknesses. Also provided are modes for single exhibition matches, either against the computer or against a friend.

The action is viewed from above with large player sprites. Violent play is encouraged as there are no free kicks. Whereas later sports games often carry heavy focus on the attention to detail, this game is rather simplified -- you can only control the player closest to the ball, for example, and it is missing many of the rules of soccer such as penalty flags and offsides.","World Cup Soccer (Japan) (En).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/World Cup Soccer (Japan) (En).png","miximages/megadrive/World Cup Soccer (Japan) (En).png","screenshots/megadrive/World Cup Soccer (Japan) (En).png","titlescreens/megadrive/World Cup Soccer (Japan) (En).png","3dboxes/megadrive/World Cup Soccer (Japan) (En).png","backcovers/megadrive/World Cup Soccer (Japan) (En).png","marquees/megadrive/World Cup Soccer (Japan) (En).png"
"megadrive_world-cup-usa-94","World Cup USA 94","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-06-01","1994","1990s","U.S. Gold","Tiertex","Sports / Football (Soccer)","Sports","1-4","1","4","70","3.5","For the third World Cup in succession, US Gold had the license to produce the official game. They entrusted Tiertex with the task, who produced a top-down game recreating the full tournament. As well as the 24 teams who qualified for the tournament, other significant footballing nations like England, France and Denmark could be drafted in. The presentation of the menus is largely icon-based, with the official mascot featuring prominently. Tackling is difficult and passing is easy, making for a flowing end-to-end style of play.","World Cup USA 94 (USA, Europe, Korea) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv).7z","7Z","0.31","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/World Cup USA 94 (USA, Europe, Korea) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv).png","miximages/megadrive/World Cup USA 94 (USA, Europe, Korea) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv).png","screenshots/megadrive/World Cup USA 94 (USA, Europe, Korea) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv).png","titlescreens/megadrive/World Cup USA 94 (USA, Europe, Korea) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv).png","3dboxes/megadrive/World Cup USA 94 (USA, Europe, Korea) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv).png","backcovers/megadrive/World Cup USA 94 (USA, Europe, Korea) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv).png","marquees/megadrive/World Cup USA 94 (USA, Europe, Korea) (En,Fr,De,Es,It,Nl,Pt,Sv).png"
