"megadrive_wrestle-war","Wrestle War","megadrive","Sega Mega Drive / Genesis","Mega Drive","Sega","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1991-10-01","1991","1990s","SEGA","SEGA","Fighting","Fighting","1-2","1","2","70","3.5","Wrestle War is a port of the arcade game of the same name.  You must take a rookie pro-wrestler, Bruce Blade, through a series of bouts to win the championship.  There is no license.  You wrestle in the ""Sega Wrestling Alliance.""  However, many of the characters bear a strong resemblance to popular wrestlers or movie characters.

