The game (or the European PAL version) is best known for being the origin of the infamous ""All Your Base"" 2001 Internet meme.","Zero Wing (USA, Europe) (Retro-Bit).7z","7Z","0","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/megadrive/Zero Wing (USA, Europe) (Retro-Bit).png","miximages/megadrive/Zero Wing (USA, Europe) (Retro-Bit).png","screenshots/megadrive/Zero Wing (USA, Europe) (Retro-Bit).png","titlescreens/megadrive/Zero Wing (USA, Europe) (Retro-Bit).png","3dboxes/megadrive/Zero Wing (USA, Europe) (Retro-Bit).png","backcovers/megadrive/Zero Wing (USA, Europe) (Retro-Bit).png","marquees/megadrive/Zero Wing (USA, Europe) (Retro-Bit).png"
