"sega32x_clayfighter-2","ClayFighter 2","sega32x","Sega 32X","Sega 32X","Sega","4./5. kynslóð (32-bit viðbót)","1995-02-01","1995","1990s","Interplay","Interplay","Fighting / 2D","Fighting","1-2","1","2","","","ClayFighter 2: Judgment Clay is the sequel to ClayFighter, and was released for the Super Nintendo Entertainment System in early 1995. At one stage it was also set for release on the Sega 32X during the same timeframe, but despite being advertised, this version was cancelled for unknown reasons. The title of the game is a reference to the movie Terminator 2: Judgment Day.","ClayFighter 2 - Judgment Clay (Prototype).32x","32X","1","true","true","true","true","true","false","true","true","covers/sega32x/ClayFighter 2 - Judgment Clay (Prototype).png","miximages/sega32x/ClayFighter 2 - Judgment Clay (Prototype).png","screenshots/sega32x/ClayFighter 2 - Judgment Clay (Prototype).png","titlescreens/sega32x/ClayFighter 2 - Judgment Clay (Prototype).png","3dboxes/sega32x/ClayFighter 2 - Judgment Clay (Prototype).png","","marquees/sega32x/ClayFighter 2 - Judgment Clay (Prototype).png"
