"sega32x_knuckles-chaotix","Knuckles' Chaotix","sega32x","Sega 32X","Sega 32X","Sega","4./5. kynslóð (32-bit viðbót)","1995-05-01","1995","1990s","Sonic Team","SEGA","Platform","Platformer","1-2","1","2","80","4","Knuckles' Chaotix is a spin-off of the Sonic the Hedgehog series of Genesis games. Knuckles the Echidna (from Sonic the Hedgehog 3) works at Carnival Island, an amusement park where his job is to protect the park and make it a happy place for visitors. Dr. Robotnik, as usual, has an evil plan for the park. He wants the power emerald which supplies electricity to the entire island. What's worse, he has imprisoned several of Knuckles' friends in the ""combi confiner."" This contraption only allows Knuckles to free one of his friends at a time by using a ring force bond. 

