Battle Tycoon is an anime-themed 2D fighting game, and the sequel to Flash Hiders. There is a standard versus mode, as well the ""Advance"" mode which follows a character's story, and allows for a great deal of RPG-like customization and power-up to your character.","Battle Tycoon - Flash Hiders SFX (JP, Rev 1).sfc","SFC","3","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Battle Tycoon - Flash Hiders SFX (JP, Rev 1).png","miximages/snes/Battle Tycoon - Flash Hiders SFX (JP, Rev 1).png","screenshots/snes/Battle Tycoon - Flash Hiders SFX (JP, Rev 1).png","titlescreens/snes/Battle Tycoon - Flash Hiders SFX (JP, Rev 1).png","3dboxes/snes/Battle Tycoon - Flash Hiders SFX (JP, Rev 1).png","backcovers/snes/Battle Tycoon - Flash Hiders SFX (JP, Rev 1).png","marquees/snes/Battle Tycoon - Flash Hiders SFX (JP, Rev 1).png"
