The elves are on strike as Christmas draws near,
but much worse than that, there's something to fear!

Give Santa the potion to drink and he'll change, he'll become ""Anti Claus"" on a rampage of rage!

He'll break all the toys, he'll ignore his good work.
Could it be Santa is just a fat jerk?

You must help Santa find his way, fix all the toys and take off in his sleigh.

Through 24 levels you'll put up a fight.
Can you help save Christmas? Let's find out tonight!","Daze Before Christmas (NTSC Conversion).sfc","SFC","2","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Daze Before Christmas (NTSC Conversion).png","miximages/snes/Daze Before Christmas (NTSC Conversion).png","screenshots/snes/Daze Before Christmas (NTSC Conversion).png","titlescreens/snes/Daze Before Christmas (NTSC Conversion).png","3dboxes/snes/Daze Before Christmas (NTSC Conversion).png","backcovers/snes/Daze Before Christmas (NTSC Conversion).png","marquees/snes/Daze Before Christmas (NTSC Conversion).png"
