"snes_dragon-the-bruce-lee-story","Dragon : The Bruce Lee Story","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-01-01","1994","1990s","Virgin Interactive","Virgin Interactive","Beat'em Up","Beat 'em up","1-3","1","3","70","3.5","Dragon: The Bruce Lee Story  is a action/fighting game in which you play Bruce Lee, the infamous martial arts master.

