"snes_dragon-ball-z-final-bout","Dragon Ball Z - Final Bout","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1998-06-04","1998","1990s","Unknown","DVS Electronic","Fighting","Fighting","1","1","1","","","Dragon Ball Z: Final Bout for Super Nintendo is an Asian pirate (bootleg) version, not an official Bandai release. Based on the PlayStation game Dragon Ball GT: Final Bout, this version uses sprites from the Super Butōden series and features poor gameplay, low-quality graphics, and audio taken from other titles.","Dragon Ball Z - Final Bout (TW).sfc","SFC","4","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/snes/Dragon Ball Z - Final Bout (TW).png","miximages/snes/Dragon Ball Z - Final Bout (TW).png","screenshots/snes/Dragon Ball Z - Final Bout (TW).png","titlescreens/snes/Dragon Ball Z - Final Bout (TW).png","3dboxes/snes/Dragon Ball Z - Final Bout (TW).png","backcovers/snes/Dragon Ball Z - Final Bout (TW).png","marquees/snes/Dragon Ball Z - Final Bout (TW).png"
