"snes_espn-sunday-night-nfl","ESPN Sunday Night NFL","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-11-01","1994","1990s","Ringler","Sony Imagesoft","Sports / Football (American)","Sports","1-2","1","2","50","2.5","ESPN Sunday Night NFL was one of the many football games released back in the day. It features all 28 official NFL teams and their respective logos, but doesn't feature a license from the NFLPA, so there are no actual players names in the game.

