"snes_gourmet-sentai-bara-yarou","Gourmet Sentai - Bara Yarou","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-09-29","1995","1990s","Fupac","Virgin Interactive","Beat'em Up","Beat 'em up","1-2","1","2","80","4","In Gourmet Sentai: Bara Yarou the player picks from three characters: Bonjour, Mademoiselle, and Très Bien. Each has slightly different movesets to use on downed or stunned opponents, but each posses the punch, throw, and jump usual for belt-scrolling brawlers. The characters must get past several minor enemies on each level before fighting a stronger boss at the end. Each enemy will drop a cooking ingredient when defeated, and at the end of each level two ingredients can be combined to make a meal that will restore some health based on if the chosen character likes it or not. Environments range from slums and palaces to high speed trains and space ships, but in general there is not much continuity between different areas.","Gourmet Warriors (NA).sfc","SFC","2.5","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Gourmet Warriors (NA).png","miximages/snes/Gourmet Warriors (NA).png","screenshots/snes/Gourmet Warriors (NA).png","titlescreens/snes/Gourmet Warriors (NA).png","3dboxes/snes/Gourmet Warriors (NA).png","backcovers/snes/Gourmet Warriors (NA).png","marquees/snes/Gourmet Warriors (NA).png"
"snes_gp-1","GP-1","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-01-01","1993","1990s","Genki","Atlus","Racing, Driving","Racing","1-2","1","2","70","3.5","GP-1 is a racing game with motorcycles. The player races against 15 opponents on 13 tracks located in 12 different countries.  There is an Exhibition mode that can support two players and the Season mode where the player can choose from six different bikes.  Once the player starts to do well in the career mode, they can purchase upgrades and parts for their bike. The player can also choose a mechanic to fix their bikes.","GP-1 (NA).sfc","SFC","1","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/GP-1 (NA).png","miximages/snes/GP-1 (NA).png","screenshots/snes/GP-1 (NA).png","titlescreens/snes/GP-1 (NA).png","3dboxes/snes/GP-1 (NA).png","backcovers/snes/GP-1 (NA).png","marquees/snes/GP-1 (NA).png"
