"snes_international-tennis-tour","International Tennis Tour","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-01-01","1993","1990s","Loriciel","Loriciel","Sports / Tennis","Sports","1-2","1","2","80","4","International Tennis Tour puts the player behind the racket of a generic male tennis player going up against a plethora of other generic players in various game modes.  There is a practice mode where the player can learn the in and outs of the game along with an exhibition mode where they can choose settings, rules and opposing players.

