"snes_packy-amp-marlon","Packy &amp; Marlon","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-06-01","1995","1990s","WaveQuest","Raya Systems","Platform","Platformer","1-2","1","2","40","2","Oh no! Packy and Marlon, two pachyderm pals with diabetes, are in heavy trouble. Summer camp has been raided by rats! The pesky critters have stolen food and critical diabetes supplies. Can Packy and Marlon find the food and supplies? To do it, they have to blast vicious varmints with peanuts and water. They have to remember to eat healthy stuff, check blood glucose levels, and take insulin!","Packy &amp; Marlon (NA).sfc","SFC","0","false","false","false","false","false","false","false","false","","","","","","",""
"snes_paladin-s-quest","Paladin's Quest","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-10-02","1993","1990s","Copya System","Enix","Role Playing Game","RPG","1","1","1","50","2.5","Paladin's Quest throws you into the mysterious world of Lennus, whose two continents have lived in tension since an ancient disaster. Thirteen years after the event, you grow up as Chezni in a magic school built upon the ruins of a sealed evil. You want to master the elements – but one reckless dare changes everything. You enter the forbidden tower, awaken the machine Dal Gren after ten thousand years of sleep and unleash a force far beyond your control. With the power-hungry Zaygos already ruling the southern continent, you quickly realize that your choice may shift the fate of the entire world – and that you're the one who now has to deal with the consequences.","Paladin's Quest (NA).sfc","SFC","1.5","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Paladin's Quest (NA).png","miximages/snes/Paladin's Quest (NA).png","screenshots/snes/Paladin's Quest (NA).png","titlescreens/snes/Paladin's Quest (NA).png","3dboxes/snes/Paladin's Quest (NA).png","backcovers/snes/Paladin's Quest (NA).png","marquees/snes/Paladin's Quest (NA).png"
"snes_tetris-attack","Tetris Attack","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1996-11-28","1996","1990s","Intelligent Systems","Nintendo","Puzzle / Fall","Puzzle","1-2","1","2","80","4","Tetris Attack throws Yoshi's Island into turmoil – King Bowser has cast a dark spell, turning nearly all its inhabitants into mindless servants. Only Yoshi has escaped, and he must set out to rescue his friends and defeat Bowser. The game blends fast-paced puzzle action with colorful Yoshi's Island charm, as you swap blocks to create rows, trigger combos, and unleash massive garbage blocks on your opponents. Alongside the story mode, you'll find two-player battles, endless play, time trials, and tricky puzzles. Beneath its Western name lies the Japanese original Panel de Pon – now starring Yoshi and his vibrant island crew.","Panel de Pon (English Translated by Zuqkeo).sfc","SFC","1.5","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Panel de Pon (English Translated by Zuqkeo).png","miximages/snes/Panel de Pon (English Translated by Zuqkeo).png","screenshots/snes/Panel de Pon (English Translated by Zuqkeo).png","titlescreens/snes/Panel de Pon (English Translated by Zuqkeo).png","3dboxes/snes/Panel de Pon (English Translated by Zuqkeo).png","backcovers/snes/Panel de Pon (English Translated by Zuqkeo).png","marquees/snes/Panel de Pon (English Translated by Zuqkeo).png"
