"snes_star-trek-deep-space-nine-crossroads-of-time","Star Trek, Deep Space Nine : Crossroads of Time","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-09-01","1995","1990s","Novotrade","Playmates Interactive","Adventure","Adventure","1","1","1","60","3","""Star Trek: Deep Space Nine - Crossroads of Time"" is a 2D action adventure based on the famous TV series.

