"snes_supapoon-dx","Supapoon Dx","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1996-05-31","1996","1990s","Now Production","Yutaka","Unknown","Unknown","1-2","1","2","60","3","Supapoon DX is specifically an enhanced remake of 1995's Supapoon. It uses the same world map but features different levels and power-ups. It also includes an intro cutscene for the single-player game and, most overtly, introduces a competitive two-player versus mode. The two-player mode gives each player their own screen of blocks to eliminate, and various power-ups are meant to make the game more challenging for their opponent, such as an arrow that drops the opponent's blocks down a space.","Supapoon DX (JP).sfc","SFC","1","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/snes/Supapoon DX (JP).png","miximages/snes/Supapoon DX (JP).png","screenshots/snes/Supapoon DX (JP).png","titlescreens/snes/Supapoon DX (JP).png","3dboxes/snes/Supapoon DX (JP).png","backcovers/snes/Supapoon DX (JP).png","marquees/snes/Supapoon DX (JP).png"
"snes_super-3d-noah-s-ark","Super 3D Noah's Ark","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-01-01","1994","1990s","Wisdom Tree","Wisdom Tree","Shooter / FPV","Shooter","1","1","1","10","0.5","It's been a long journey. In just a few days, the ark doors will open and Noah, his family &amp; the animals will be back on dry land. But the animals have become a bit restless and are out of their cages. Camels, giraffes, monkeys, kangaroos and more are wondering throughout the corridors of the ark. As Noah, it's your job to regain order &amp; get the animals to sleep until you leave the ark. You only tool to accomplish this in the food you brought aboard the ark.","Super 3D Noah's Ark (NA).sfc","SFC","1","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Super 3D Noah's Ark (NA).png","miximages/snes/Super 3D Noah's Ark (NA).png","screenshots/snes/Super 3D Noah's Ark (NA).png","titlescreens/snes/Super 3D Noah's Ark (NA).png","3dboxes/snes/Super 3D Noah's Ark (NA).png","backcovers/snes/Super 3D Noah's Ark (NA).png","marquees/snes/Super 3D Noah's Ark (NA).png"
"snes_super-adventure-island","Super Adventure Island","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1992-11-19","1992","1990s","Hudson Soft","Hudson Soft","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","80","4","You are a caveman named Master Higgins. You have a beautiful girlfriend, and you like spending time sunbathing together on high trees and other places on the tropic island Waku-Waku. But all of a sudden, an evil magician turns your wife into a stone! As you begin to realize what happened, a bird grasps you and throws down somewhere on the island. You have to find your way back and to save your girl from the grim reality of petrification...

This emotional drama turns out to be a rather simple platform game. The short, linear levels are all timed, so you have to hurry up and not to get delayed by the many treasures you might find on your way. You will have a weapon, your old trusty boomerang, which you will be able to upgrade during the game. After a series on levels, you will be invited to a boss battle. The sooner you complete a level, the more bonus points you get.","Super Adventure Island (NA).sfc","SFC","1","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Super Adventure Island (NA).png","miximages/snes/Super Adventure Island (NA).png","screenshots/snes/Super Adventure Island (NA).png","titlescreens/snes/Super Adventure Island (NA).png","3dboxes/snes/Super Adventure Island (NA).png","backcovers/snes/Super Adventure Island (NA).png","marquees/snes/Super Adventure Island (NA).png"
"snes_super-adventure-island-ii","Super Adventure Island II","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-01-01","1995","1990s","Hudson Soft","Hudson Soft","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","80","4","Master Higgins finally marries his lovely girlfriend Tina. But out of nowhere, a powerful tropical cyclone destroyed the idyllic mood of their honeymoon. And not only this: it separated the ardent lovers again. After the winds stopped blowing, Tina found herself somewhere on a tropical coast. As for Master Higgins, he went to the king of Waku-Waku and, along with his main quest to save his brand new wife, got an assignment to save also a princess, whom the king was about to marry. Is there a connection between those two events?..

No, this is not a detective/mystery game, but platform arcade action. What distinguish the game clearly not only from ordinary platformers, but also from the first Super Adventure Island, are its light role-playing and puzzle-solving flavors. You don't have a time limit, but huge levels with many secret sub-levels to find, puzzles to solve, and treasure chests to unlock. You also can have equipment, such as swords, shields, etc. By defeating enemies, you gain health items, money, etc. Your HP is measured by hearts, and it can increase during the game if you find appropriate items. You also encounter random enemies while traveling on a world map.","Super Adventure Island II (NA).sfc","SFC","1.5","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Super Adventure Island II (NA).png","miximages/snes/Super Adventure Island II (NA).png","screenshots/snes/Super Adventure Island II (NA).png","titlescreens/snes/Super Adventure Island II (NA).png","3dboxes/snes/Super Adventure Island II (NA).png","backcovers/snes/Super Adventure Island II (NA).png","marquees/snes/Super Adventure Island II (NA).png"
