"snes_super-bases-loaded","Super Bases Loaded","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1991-09-01","1991","1990s","TOSE","Jaleco","Sports / Baseball","Sports","1-2","1","2","70","3.5","Super Bases Loaded is about more than winning – it's about perfection. You choose one of 13 fictional teams and face the rest in succession. Every mistake, walk, and strikeout affects your score. The better you play, the tougher your next opponent. Only a perfect 100-point game against a level 5 team will finish the game. Whether pitching or hitting, it's all in your hands – even the rules are up to you.","Super Bases Loaded (NA).sfc","SFC","1","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Super Bases Loaded (NA).png","miximages/snes/Super Bases Loaded (NA).png","screenshots/snes/Super Bases Loaded (NA).png","titlescreens/snes/Super Bases Loaded (NA).png","3dboxes/snes/Super Bases Loaded (NA).png","backcovers/snes/Super Bases Loaded (NA).png","marquees/snes/Super Bases Loaded (NA).png"
