"snes_super-play-action-football","Super Play Action Football","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1992-08-01","1992","1990s","Nintendo","Nintendo","Sports / Football (American)","Sports","1-2","1","2","50","2.5","The 16-bit sequel to NES Play Action Football.  Graphics are from the same three-quarters perspective as the original.  There are now three levels of play to choose from: high school, college, or professional.  All 28 real NFL teams are included, but Nintendo did not secure the NFLPA or NCAA licenses, so there are no real player names or real universities.  College play features weekly poll rankings, conference schedules, and bowl games.  NFL play includes both the regular season and playoffs.","Super Play Action Football (NA).sfc","SFC","1","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Super Play Action Football (NA).png","miximages/snes/Super Play Action Football (NA).png","screenshots/snes/Super Play Action Football (NA).png","titlescreens/snes/Super Play Action Football (NA).png","3dboxes/snes/Super Play Action Football (NA).png","backcovers/snes/Super Play Action Football (NA).png","marquees/snes/Super Play Action Football (NA).png"
"snes_super-power-league","Super Power League","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1993-08-06","1993","1990s","Now Production","Hudson Soft","Sports / Baseball","Sports","1-4","1","4","80","4","Super Power League is a baseball game from Now Production (a.k.a. Nowpro) and published by Hudson Soft for the Super Famicom in Japan only. The game uses large sprites for the batters and focuses a little more on realism than many of its more Arcade-ish peers. It includes a Home Run Derby mode, as well as a pennant race and all-star games.","Super Power League (JP).sfc","SFC","1.5","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/snes/Super Power League (JP).png","miximages/snes/Super Power League (JP).png","screenshots/snes/Super Power League (JP).png","titlescreens/snes/Super Power League (JP).png","3dboxes/snes/Super Power League (JP).png","backcovers/snes/Super Power League (JP).png","marquees/snes/Super Power League (JP).png"
