The beast is among us! This is it - a whole new dimension in computer games! Loaded with awesome features: 50 frames per second arcade-quality scroll, 350 screens, 132 unique monsters, 13 levels of parallax scrolling, 900K of emotive music, and 2MB of graphics compressed in two disks! A truly massive game!","Super Shadow of the Beast (Prototype).sfc","SFC","1","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Super Shadow of the Beast (Prototype).png","miximages/snes/Super Shadow of the Beast (Prototype).png","screenshots/snes/Super Shadow of the Beast (Prototype).png","titlescreens/snes/Super Shadow of the Beast (Prototype).png","3dboxes/snes/Super Shadow of the Beast (Prototype).png","backcovers/snes/Super Shadow of the Beast (Prototype).png","marquees/snes/Super Shadow of the Beast (Prototype).png"
