Now Leonardo, Raphael, Donatello, and Michaelangelo have to fight their way through time and tons of Foot Soldiers, mutant wackos, and more in order to save April and slam Shredder's butt all the way to Dimension X! Go, Turtles! Kick some shell and save April!","Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles IV - Turtles in Time (NA).sfc","SFC","1","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles IV - Turtles in Time (NA).png","miximages/snes/Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles IV - Turtles in Time (NA).png","screenshots/snes/Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles IV - Turtles in Time (NA).png","titlescreens/snes/Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles IV - Turtles in Time (NA).png","3dboxes/snes/Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles IV - Turtles in Time (NA).png","backcovers/snes/Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles IV - Turtles in Time (NA).png","marquees/snes/Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles IV - Turtles in Time (NA).png"
