"snes_the-ren-amp-stimpy-show-buckeroo","The Ren &amp; Stimpy Show : Buckeroo$!","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1995-04-01","1995","1990s","Imagineer","THQ","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","40","2","Stimpy invents the Gametron 5000 Moneymaker which is the first video game machine in the world that rewards the player with money. Ren, who is always on the lookout to get rich, eagerly gets to playing with the video game system on the quest to earn big bucks. 

