"snes_u-f-o-kamen-yakisoban-kettler-no-kuroi-inbou","U.f.o. Kamen Yakisoban - Kettler No Kuroi Inbou","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-10-14","1994","1990s","Kindle Imagine Develop","Den'Z","Beat'em Up","Beat 'em up","1","1","1","60","3","UFO Kamen Yakisoban: Kettler no Kuroi Inbou (""UFO Kamen Yakisoban: Kettler's Black Conspiracy"") is a brawler featuring UFO Kamen Yakisoban, a character designed to market Nissin's Yakisoba UFO brand of instant yakisoba circa 1993-1995. It understandably features a variety of foodstuffs.

