"snes_u-n-squadron","U.N. Squadron","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1992-12-10","1992","1990s","Capcom","Capcom","Shoot'em Up / Horizontal","Shooter","1","1","1","80","4","In U.N. Squadron, the aim is to eliminate the enemy, who have gathered around the Allied airspace of ""Area 88"", in a series of scenarios based on military aircraft.
