"snes_wrecking-crew-98","Wrecking Crew '98","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1998-05-23","1998","1990s","Pax Softnica","Nintendo","Puzzle","Puzzle","1-2","1","2","70","3.5","Mario, on his way home from a trip, discovers that Bowser has been conducting a construction campaign of building high-rises in the Mushroom Kingdom which are depriving the local plantlife of sunlight. Refusing to tolerate this, he brings out a mighty blue hammer from a chest inside his house and embarks on a mission to demolish the offending structures. Mario's old nemesis, Foreman Spike, along with a Gotcha Wrench, Eggplant Man, and more new and old enemies, are once again out to stop him on his quest, however.","Wrecking Crew '98 (English Translated by ShadowOne333, Rev 2).sfc","SFC","2","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/snes/Wrecking Crew '98 (English Translated by ShadowOne333, Rev 2).png","miximages/snes/Wrecking Crew '98 (English Translated by ShadowOne333, Rev 2).png","screenshots/snes/Wrecking Crew '98 (English Translated by ShadowOne333, Rev 2).png","titlescreens/snes/Wrecking Crew '98 (English Translated by ShadowOne333, Rev 2).png","3dboxes/snes/Wrecking Crew '98 (English Translated by ShadowOne333, Rev 2).png","backcovers/snes/Wrecking Crew '98 (English Translated by ShadowOne333, Rev 2).png","marquees/snes/Wrecking Crew '98 (English Translated by ShadowOne333, Rev 2).png"
"snes_wwf-raw","WWF Raw","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-12-01","1994","1990s","Sculptured Software","LJN","Sports / Fighting","Sports","1-4","1","4","60","3","WWF Raw is a professional wrestling game featuring 10 superstars from the World Wrestling Federation.  The wrestlers you can choose from include Bret ""Hit Man"" Hart, Bam Bam Bigelow, 1-2-3 Kid, Diesel, Doink, Lex Luger, Luna Vachon, Owen Hart, Razor Ramon, Shawn Michaels, Undertaker, and Yokozuna.

