"snes_zero-4-champ-rr","Zero 4 Champ Rr","snes","Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) / Super Famicom","SNES","Nintendo","4. kynslóð (16-bit)","1994-07-22","1994","1990s","Media Rings","Media Rings","Racing, Driving","Racing","1-4","1","4","80","4","Zero4 Champ RR is a 1994 racing video game developed by Media Rings for the Super Famicom, about an 18-year-old race car driver who must chase his dreams of drag racing after being turned down for university (and becoming a r?nin due to his joblessness status).

