"saturn_myst","Myst","saturn","Sega Saturn","Saturn","Sega","5. kynslóð (32-bit)","1995-10-06","1995","1990s","Interprog","SEGA","Adventure / Point and Click","Adventure","1","1","1","70","3.5","You have just stumbled upon a most intriguing book, a book titled Myst. You have no idea where it came from, who wrote it, or how old it is. Reading through its pages provides you with only a superbly crafted description of an island world. But it's just a book, isn't it? As you reach the end of the book, you lay your hand on a page. Suddenly your own world dissolves into blackness, replaced with the island world the pages described. Now you're here, wherever here is, with no option but to explore.

