"saturn_purikura-daisakusen","Purikura Daisakusen","saturn","Sega Saturn","Saturn","Sega","5. kynslóð (32-bit)","1996-11-15","1996","1990s","Atlus","Atlus","Shoot'em Up","Shooter","1-2","1","2","60","3","In Purikura Daisakusen, the Miracle Kingdom has been invaded by an evil mechanical army, all of its inhabitants have been magically transformed into animals, and the queen has been imprisoned. Taking on the role of either the gallant knight Grey, or one of the queen's sisters Kurara or Kirara, the player must reach the queen and save the land while demolishing any creature that stands in their way. The game plays as an isometric scrolling shooter, in which the player must navigate their chosen character through stages, killing enemies with magic attacks while collecting power-ups and other unique items.
