"n64_clay-fighter-sculptor-s-cut","Clay Fighter : Sculptor's Cut","n64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (64-bit)","1998-05-01","1998","1990s","Interplay","Interplay","Fighting / Versus","Fighting","1-2","1","2","70","3.5","Get ready to crumble... with this special edition of the world's funniest fighting game! This ""director's cut"" contains many extras added to the original Clay Fighter 63 1/3 game. You might lose lives, you might lose limbs, but don't lose your sense of humor! 12 eccentric fighters plus 4 additional clay combatants only found in this version. More snide remarks and barbed wit will have you crying from laughing so hard! Original characters get additional attacks for an all-new experience. Enhanced camera angle stays put to see more details in the environment and improve fight control!","Clay Fighter - Sculptor's Cut (NA).z64","Z64","16","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/n64/Clay Fighter - Sculptor's Cut (NA).png","miximages/n64/Clay Fighter - Sculptor's Cut (NA).png","screenshots/n64/Clay Fighter - Sculptor's Cut (NA).png","titlescreens/n64/Clay Fighter - Sculptor's Cut (NA).png","3dboxes/n64/Clay Fighter - Sculptor's Cut (NA).png","backcovers/n64/Clay Fighter - Sculptor's Cut (NA).png","marquees/n64/Clay Fighter - Sculptor's Cut (NA).png"
