"n64_densha-de-go-64","Densha De Go! 64","n64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (64-bit)","1999-07-30","1999","1990s","AI","Taito","Simulation / Vehicle","Strategy / Sim","1","1","1","80","4","Densha De Go!! 64 is a train simulation game that puts players in the role of a train operator, tasked with navigating various real-life train routes throughout Japan.

The game includes a variety of real-life train routes from across Japan, each with its own unique characteristics and challenges. These routes range from short urban commuter lines to long-distance express trains that travel through scenic countryside.

Players must control the train's speed, braking, and acceleration to ensure a smooth and timely arrival at each station. They must also pay attention to traffic signals and other regulations to avoid accidents and delays. The game provides a heads-up display that shows key information such as the train's speed, distance to the next station, and time remaining until the next scheduled stop.","Densha de Go! 64 (English Translated, Rev 1.01, by Zoinkity).z64","Z64","30","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/n64/Densha de Go! 64 (English Translated, Rev 1.01, by Zoinkity).png","miximages/n64/Densha de Go! 64 (English Translated, Rev 1.01, by Zoinkity).png","screenshots/n64/Densha de Go! 64 (English Translated, Rev 1.01, by Zoinkity).png","titlescreens/n64/Densha de Go! 64 (English Translated, Rev 1.01, by Zoinkity).png","3dboxes/n64/Densha de Go! 64 (English Translated, Rev 1.01, by Zoinkity).png","backcovers/n64/Densha de Go! 64 (English Translated, Rev 1.01, by Zoinkity).png","marquees/n64/Densha de Go! 64 (English Translated, Rev 1.01, by Zoinkity).png"
