"n64_frogger-2-swampy-s-revenge","Frogger 2 : Swampy's Revenge","n64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (64-bit)","1999-01-01","1999","1990s","Blitz Games","Hasbro Interactive","Platform","Platformer","1-4","1","4","70","3.5","Frogger 2: Swampy's Revenge is a video game released in 2000. The game is part of the Frogger series, and the sequel to the 1997 remake of Frogger, featuring similar 4-way movement gameplay in a 3D world and 6 different environments. Unlike its predecessor, Frogger 2 featured a choice of different characters to play with in the game, several multiplayer modes, and an in-game storyline. A Nintendo 64 port of the game was planned, but it was cancelled.

