"n64_mrc-multi-racing-championship","MRC - Multi Racing Championship","n64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (64-bit)","1997-10-31","1997","1990s","Genki","Ocean","Racing, Driving","Racing","1-2","1","2","70","3.5","Sit down, strap in and hang on for the most extreme racing challenge the world has to offer. Race over a variety of terrains, battle the elements and secure your place among rally racing's most elite drivers. MRC's fully customizable settings let you equip your vehicle to exploit road conditions and weather to your advantage! Choose from 8 high-performance, fully customizable vehicles, plus two secret vehicles. Navigate through three challenging courses. Enjoy multiple viewing perspectives from a racer's bird's-eye perspective to behind-the-vehicle views. Speed through highly detailed backgrounds, amazing graphics and impressive sound effects for a realistic racing experience.","MRC - Multi-Racing Championship (NA).z64","Z64","12","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/n64/MRC - Multi-Racing Championship (NA).png","miximages/n64/MRC - Multi-Racing Championship (NA).png","screenshots/n64/MRC - Multi-Racing Championship (NA).png","titlescreens/n64/MRC - Multi-Racing Championship (NA).png","3dboxes/n64/MRC - Multi-Racing Championship (NA).png","backcovers/n64/MRC - Multi-Racing Championship (NA).png","marquees/n64/MRC - Multi-Racing Championship (NA).png"
"n64_ms-pac-man-maze-madness","Ms. Pac-Man : Maze Madness","n64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (64-bit)","2000-11-12","2000","2000s","Namco","Namco","Action / Labyrinth","Action","1-4","1","4","70","3.5","Ms. Pac-Man Maze Madness is a combination of classic Pac-Man (or in this case, Ms. Pac-Man) action, maze exploration and Sokoban-like puzzle elements. Players take on the role of Ms. Pac-Man and have to save Pac-Land once again. Although the game is in full 3D, players can only move along designated paths.

The four Wonders, mystical regions separated from the rest of Pac-Land by force fields, contains four Gems of Virtue: Generosity, Truth, Wisdom and Courage, each holding enough power to help keep Pac-Land safe from evil. However, an unknown enemy has transformed the Enchanted Castle into a haunted house, in turn starting a chain reaction of evil all around Pac-Land and the four Wonders. It is up to Ms. Pac-Man to enter the 3D designed worlds of the four Wonders and put the evil to rest for good.","Ms. Pac-Man - Maze Madness (NA).z64","Z64","12","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/n64/Ms. Pac-Man - Maze Madness (NA).png","miximages/n64/Ms. Pac-Man - Maze Madness (NA).png","screenshots/n64/Ms. Pac-Man - Maze Madness (NA).png","titlescreens/n64/Ms. Pac-Man - Maze Madness (NA).png","3dboxes/n64/Ms. Pac-Man - Maze Madness (NA).png","backcovers/n64/Ms. Pac-Man - Maze Madness (NA).png","marquees/n64/Ms. Pac-Man - Maze Madness (NA).png"
"n64_mystical-ninja-starring-goemon","Mystical Ninja Starring Goemon","n64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (64-bit)","1998-04-18","1998","1990s","Konami","Konami","Action / Adventure","Adventure","1","1","1","90","4.5","Mystical Ninja Starring Goemon is an action-based RPG similar in style to The Legend of Zelda: The Ocarina of Time.  It is also the first localized Goemon game since The Legend of the Mystical Ninja for the SNES.  Players control Goemon and his friends as they make their way through Ancient Japan to stop the Peach Mountain Shoguns.  You can talk to characters, whack enemies with your pipe (or hurl coins at them), visit a deranged fortune teller who shrieks out ""PLASMA!"" at random intervals for no reason, and more.

Each member of the Goemon team can also learn a special ability to access new areas as players progress through the game.  Goemon earns the ""Sudden Impact"" power, which lets him move blocks he normally couldn't, Ebisumaru can shrink to small sizes so he can pass through tiny cracks, Sasuke earns an extra high jump, and Yae gets the ability to transform into a Mermaid so that she can swim underwater.","Mystical Ninja Starring Goemon (NA).z64","Z64","16","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/n64/Mystical Ninja Starring Goemon (NA).png","miximages/n64/Mystical Ninja Starring Goemon (NA).png","screenshots/n64/Mystical Ninja Starring Goemon (NA).png","titlescreens/n64/Mystical Ninja Starring Goemon (NA).png","3dboxes/n64/Mystical Ninja Starring Goemon (NA).png","backcovers/n64/Mystical Ninja Starring Goemon (NA).png","marquees/n64/Mystical Ninja Starring Goemon (NA).png"
