"n64_nuclear-strike-64","Nuclear Strike 64","n64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (64-bit)","2000-03-03","2000","2000s","Pacific Coast Power &amp; Light","THQ","Shooter / Plane, TPV","Shooter","1","1","1","60","3","Nuclear Strike 64 is a helicopter-based game, with strategy elements added to the action gameplay. The plot concerns an elite special force - the player's allies - pursuing a nuclear-armed rogue spy through a fictionalized Asian setting. It retained the earlier game's engine but added several modifications to improve graphical performance and make the game more accessible. The game features 15 playable vehicles, a large increase from previous games. In addition to the main fictionalized Apache, there are secondary helicopters, jets, armor and a hovercraft. The player also commands ground troops in occasional real-time strategy sections.","Nuclear Strike 64 (NA).z64","Z64","32","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/n64/Nuclear Strike 64 (NA).png","miximages/n64/Nuclear Strike 64 (NA).png","screenshots/n64/Nuclear Strike 64 (NA).png","titlescreens/n64/Nuclear Strike 64 (NA).png","3dboxes/n64/Nuclear Strike 64 (NA).png","backcovers/n64/Nuclear Strike 64 (NA).png","marquees/n64/Nuclear Strike 64 (NA).png"
