"n64_spider-man","Spider-Man","n64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo 64","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (64-bit)","2000-11-21","2000","2000s","Edge of Reality","Activision","Action / Adventure","Adventure","1","1","1","90","4.5","Spider-Man is the first 3D game to star the popular web-slinger.  It is loosely based on Spider-Man: The Animated Series and Spider-Man Unlimited and features some of the voice cast from each and similar character designs.

