Disney's 102 Dalmatians: Puppies to the Rescue on the Game Boy Color is a 2D, side-scrolling platform game. You must run and jump about the level, searching for a key. Once you have the key, you then go to each cage to open it and free the puppies. When all puppies are free, you will get a password and move to the next level. Try to avoid the enemy toys that move about as they will damage you. You can use your bark to stun a toy but that is temporary.","102 Dalmatians - Puppies to the Rescue (USA, Europe).zip","ZIP","0.31","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/gbc/102 Dalmatians - Puppies to the Rescue (USA, Europe).png","miximages/gbc/102 Dalmatians - Puppies to the Rescue (USA, Europe).png","screenshots/gbc/102 Dalmatians - Puppies to the Rescue (USA, Europe).png","titlescreens/gbc/102 Dalmatians - Puppies to the Rescue (USA, Europe).png","3dboxes/gbc/102 Dalmatians - Puppies to the Rescue (USA, Europe).png","backcovers/gbc/102 Dalmatians - Puppies to the Rescue (USA, Europe).png","marquees/gbc/102 Dalmatians - Puppies to the Rescue (USA, Europe).png"
