"gbc_catwoman","Catwoman","gbc","Nintendo Game Boy Color","Game Boy Color","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (8-bit Handheld Color)","2000-01-01","2000","2000s","Kemco","Kemco","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","50","2.5","In Catwoman, the titular Batman villainess is spun off into her own game.  Talia tries to hire Catwoman to steal a crystal skull, but Catwoman decides to keep it for herself, not knowing Ra's al Ghul plans to use it to destroy Gotham.

