The game is split into different worlds, which are split into different levels. Each level contains bonus areas, where one can collect bananas, medallions, and lives. At the end of each world is a boss, which is usually a larger version of a minor enemy.","Donkey Kong Country (USA, Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It) (Sample).zip","ZIP","1.18","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/gbc/Donkey Kong Country (USA, Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It) (Sample).png","miximages/gbc/Donkey Kong Country (USA, Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It) (Sample).png","screenshots/gbc/Donkey Kong Country (USA, Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It) (Sample).png","titlescreens/gbc/Donkey Kong Country (USA, Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It) (Sample).png","3dboxes/gbc/Donkey Kong Country (USA, Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It) (Sample).png","backcovers/gbc/Donkey Kong Country (USA, Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It) (Sample).png","marquees/gbc/Donkey Kong Country (USA, Europe) (En,Fr,De,Es,It) (Sample).png"
