"gbc_ecw-hardcore-revolution","ECW Hardcore Revolution","gbc","Nintendo Game Boy Color","Game Boy Color","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (8-bit Handheld Color)","2000-02-01","2000","2000s","Crawfish Interactive","Acclaim Entertainment","Sports / Wrestling","Sports","1","1","1","80","4","This version of Hardcore Revolution is different from its console counterparts.  This version has ten wrestlers to choose from: Mike Awesome, Balls Mahoney, Justin Credible, Tommy Dreamer, Jerry Lynn, Raven, Sabu, Lance Storm, Tajiri, Rob Van Dam, each with their own signature finishing move along with the standard set such as punch, kick, suplex as well as turnbuckle moves.

