"gbc_the-powerpuff-girls-bad-mojo-jojo","The Powerpuff Girls : Bad Mojo Jojo","gbc","Nintendo Game Boy Color","Game Boy Color","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (8-bit Handheld Color)","2000-11-14","2000","2000s","Sennari Interactive","Bam Entertainment","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","50","2.5","The Powerpuff Girls make their first appearance on the Game Boy Color with POWERPUFF GIRLS: Bad Mojo Jojo. You take the role of Blossom, who is known for her intelligence. Blossom must punch and kick her way through levels filled with puzzles that need solving, and she's got to collect all of the icons in each level. Some of them are power-ups that allow Blossom to use an ice beam to temporarily freeze her enemies, while others are artwork that can be traded between the three POWERPUFF GIRLS games. Ultimately, Blossom must come face to face with her nemesis, Mojo Jojo. Will Blossom be able to save Townsville from certain doom? Find out by playing POWERPUFF GIRLS: Bad Mojo Jojo.","Powerpuff Girls, The - Bad Mojo Jojo (USA) (Rev 2).zip","ZIP","0.56","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Bad Mojo Jojo (USA) (Rev 2).png","miximages/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Bad Mojo Jojo (USA) (Rev 2).png","screenshots/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Bad Mojo Jojo (USA) (Rev 2).png","titlescreens/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Bad Mojo Jojo (USA) (Rev 2).png","3dboxes/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Bad Mojo Jojo (USA) (Rev 2).png","backcovers/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Bad Mojo Jojo (USA) (Rev 2).png","marquees/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Bad Mojo Jojo (USA) (Rev 2).png"
"gbc_the-powerpuff-girls-battle-him","The Powerpuff Girls : Battle Him","gbc","Nintendo Game Boy Color","Game Boy Color","Nintendo","5. kynslóð (8-bit Handheld Color)","2001-07-20","2001","2000s","Sennari Interactive","Bam Entertainment","Platform","Platformer","1","1","1","50","2.5","One of three POWERPUFF GIRLS games released together on the Game Boy Color, THE POWER PUFF GIRLS: Battle Him cats you in the role of the lovable Bubbles. Bubbles' nurturing personality shines in the video game, as you help her collect power-ups and battle the infamous, evil ""Him."" She might be an elementary school student, but she'll prove just how dedicated she is to crime fighting, as you help Bubbles shoot her way through level after level of original action. Many of the items that you collect throughout the adventure can be traded for others via friends playing the other POWERPUFF GIRLS games on their systems. Although it's a one-player game, the trading aspect gives the experience a significantly interactive element. Of course, the brilliant sense of humor from the cartoon series is present throughout the adventure, as are all of the other characters you've come to love. Handheld video games just don't get much more creative (or fun) than this.","Powerpuff Girls, The - Battle Him (USA) (Rev 1).zip","ZIP","0.56","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Battle Him (USA) (Rev 1).png","miximages/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Battle Him (USA) (Rev 1).png","screenshots/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Battle Him (USA) (Rev 1).png","titlescreens/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Battle Him (USA) (Rev 1).png","3dboxes/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Battle Him (USA) (Rev 1).png","backcovers/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Battle Him (USA) (Rev 1).png","marquees/gbc/Powerpuff Girls, The - Battle Him (USA) (Rev 1).png"
