Marble Madness - A true arcade classic! Guide your marble through various courses to the goal. Avoid the marble munchers, the evil steelie marble, the acid pools, the marble-sucking vacuum, and other hazards along the way to the finish line! Mazes, ice patches, funnels, and catapults are just the beginning! Try to keep from ""losing your marbles"" as you race against time and the elements in this all-time, all-ages romp.","2 Games in One! - Marble Madness + Klax (NA).gba","GBA","4","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/gba/2 Games in One! - Marble Madness + Klax (NA).png","miximages/gba/2 Games in One! - Marble Madness + Klax (NA).png","screenshots/gba/2 Games in One! - Marble Madness + Klax (NA).png","titlescreens/gba/2 Games in One! - Marble Madness + Klax (NA).png","3dboxes/gba/2 Games in One! - Marble Madness + Klax (NA).png","backcovers/gba/2 Games in One! - Marble Madness + Klax (NA).png","marquees/gba/2 Games in One! - Marble Madness + Klax (NA).png"
