"gba_ez-talk-shokyuu-hen-1","Ez-talk - Shokyuu Hen 1","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2001-08-01","2001","2000s","Nd Cube","Keynet","Educational","Action","1","1","1","","","The first stand-alone version of English learning software on the GBA. It uses an RPG-style system in which you collect English words as items. In addition, it allows for full-fledged listening study through audio playback, which is revolutionary for a portable game console. You can learn correct English with the reliable pronunciation of native speakers.","EZ-Talk - Shokyuu Hen 1 (JP).gba","GBA","8","true","true","true","true","true","false","true","false","covers/gba/EZ-Talk - Shokyuu Hen 1 (JP).png","miximages/gba/EZ-Talk - Shokyuu Hen 1 (JP).png","screenshots/gba/EZ-Talk - Shokyuu Hen 1 (JP).png","titlescreens/gba/EZ-Talk - Shokyuu Hen 1 (JP).png","3dboxes/gba/EZ-Talk - Shokyuu Hen 1 (JP).png","","marquees/gba/EZ-Talk - Shokyuu Hen 1 (JP).png"
