"gba_need-for-speed-porsche-unleashed","Need for Speed : Porsche Unleashed","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2004-03-15","2004","2000s","Pocketeers","Ubisoft","Racing, Driving","Racing","1-2","1","2","50","2.5","Unleash the power of Porsche! Push yourself to the limit and break the will of your opponents, as you climb into the driver's seat of Destination Software's Need For Speed Porsche Unleashed racing game for your Nintendo Game Boy Advance system, sub-licensed from series originator Electronic Arts. Need for Speed Porsche Unleashed features circuit track racing, streetcar excitement, open road thrills, crashes, traffic, and more. Feel the surge of adrenaline as your own driving savvy and years of Porsche excellence come together at your fingertips for a thrilling ride at breakneck speed. Features 25 different models of Porsche cars, link cable support for four players (multiple cartridge), and cartridge save ability with four slots.","Need for Speed - Porsche Unleashed (NA).gba","GBA","4","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/gba/Need for Speed - Porsche Unleashed (NA).png","miximages/gba/Need for Speed - Porsche Unleashed (NA).png","screenshots/gba/Need for Speed - Porsche Unleashed (NA).png","titlescreens/gba/Need for Speed - Porsche Unleashed (NA).png","3dboxes/gba/Need for Speed - Porsche Unleashed (NA).png","backcovers/gba/Need for Speed - Porsche Unleashed (NA).png","marquees/gba/Need for Speed - Porsche Unleashed (NA).png"
"gba_need-for-speed-underground","Need for Speed : Underground","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2004-01-16","2004","2000s","Pocketeers","EA Games","Racing, Driving","Racing","1-4","1","4","50","2.5","Need For Speed: Underground is the seventh game in the long running Need For Speed racing series. Underground revolves around illegal nighttime streetracing with heavily modified import cars and has been greatly influenced by the movie ""The Fast And The Furious"" and its sequel.. Players get the chance to build their own racing machine almost from ground up, with hundreds or real licensed parts and lots of licensed cars, including the Mazda RX-7 and the Nissan Skyline GT-R. The game also features over 100 single player races and a hiphop/hardrock soundtrack including artists such as Mystikal, Rob Zombie and The Crystal Method.","Need for Speed - Underground (NA).gba","GBA","8","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/gba/Need for Speed - Underground (NA).png","miximages/gba/Need for Speed - Underground (NA).png","screenshots/gba/Need for Speed - Underground (NA).png","titlescreens/gba/Need for Speed - Underground (NA).png","3dboxes/gba/Need for Speed - Underground (NA).png","backcovers/gba/Need for Speed - Underground (NA).png","marquees/gba/Need for Speed - Underground (NA).png"
"gba_need-for-speed-underground-2","Need for Speed : Underground 2","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2004-11-19","2004","2000s","Pocketeers","EA Games","Racing, Driving","Racing","1-2","1","2","60","3","The popular Need For Speed Underground franchise was adapted for systems with different capabilities. You drive around a city split into 5 distinct areas. As with the other versions, the aim is to drive well enough to boost your reputation. In this version the route is prescribed, without the exploration of the other systems. Available cars include machines from Volkswagen, Mitsubishi and Toyota. There are less upgrades in this version, although the appearance and handling of your car can still be varied. The story in this version follows a predefined path.","Need for Speed - Underground 2 (NA).gba","GBA","8","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/gba/Need for Speed - Underground 2 (NA).png","miximages/gba/Need for Speed - Underground 2 (NA).png","screenshots/gba/Need for Speed - Underground 2 (NA).png","titlescreens/gba/Need for Speed - Underground 2 (NA).png","3dboxes/gba/Need for Speed - Underground 2 (NA).png","backcovers/gba/Need for Speed - Underground 2 (NA).png","marquees/gba/Need for Speed - Underground 2 (NA).png"
"gba_need-for-speed-carbon-own-the-city","Need for Speed Carbon : Own the City","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2006-10-31","2006","2000s","EA Canada","EA Games","Racing, Driving","Racing","1","1","1","50","2.5","Need for Speed Carbon delivers the next generation of adrenaline-filled street racing as players face the ultimate test of driving skill on treacherous canyon roads. What starts in the city is settled in the canyons as Need for Speed Carbon immerses you into the world's most dangerous and adrenaline-filled form of street racing. You and your crew must race in an all-out war for the city, risking everything to take over your rivals' neighbourhoods one block at a time.","Need for Speed Carbon - Own the City (NA).gba","GBA","8","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/gba/Need for Speed Carbon - Own the City (NA).png","miximages/gba/Need for Speed Carbon - Own the City (NA).png","screenshots/gba/Need for Speed Carbon - Own the City (NA).png","titlescreens/gba/Need for Speed Carbon - Own the City (NA).png","3dboxes/gba/Need for Speed Carbon - Own the City (NA).png","backcovers/gba/Need for Speed Carbon - Own the City (NA).png","marquees/gba/Need for Speed Carbon - Own the City (NA).png"
"gba_next-generation-tennis","Next Generation Tennis","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2002-05-28","2002","2000s","Wanadoo Edition","Wanadoo Edition","Sports / Tennis","Sports","1-2","1","2","60","3","Playing Next Generation Tennis is like playing a match and watching it live on TV at the same time, with slow motion replays, umpire announcements, realistic player behaviour and crowd noise all adding that touch of authenticity. With over 10 game modes (including 4 hidden ones), Next Generation Tennis offers a broad palette of pleasures, from the most classic to the most innovative.

