"gba_shining-soul-ii","Shining Soul II","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2004-04-20","2004","2000s","Nex Entertainment","THQ","Role Playing Game","RPG","1-4","1","4","70","3.5","Shining Soul II tells of a world where the balance between Light and Darkness is thrown off once again because people have long forgotten the danger that came before. After grim omens, the murder of a prophet, and dark intrigue at the royal court, it falls to a new hero to stand against the growing shadow. What begins with a tournament at the castle soon turns into a much larger journey filled with danger, monsters, and secrets. A particularly appealing touch is that characters do not just grow stronger through equipment and battles, but also become more resistant by directly enduring hazards. This gives the adventure a strong sense of momentum while pairing a classic save-the-world story with constant progress.","Shining Soul II (NA).gba","GBA","16","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/gba/Shining Soul II (NA).png","miximages/gba/Shining Soul II (NA).png","screenshots/gba/Shining Soul II (NA).png","titlescreens/gba/Shining Soul II (NA).png","3dboxes/gba/Shining Soul II (NA).png","backcovers/gba/Shining Soul II (NA).png","marquees/gba/Shining Soul II (NA).png"
