"gba_super-bust-a-move","Super Bust-A-Move","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2001-11-27","2001","2000s","Taito","Ubisoft","Puzzle / Throw","Puzzle","1-2","1","2","60","3","Super Bust-A-Move brings with it all of the entertaining puzzle action of the series with the addition of new multiplayer modes and graphical improvements.

