"gba_tiny-chao-garden","Tiny Chao Garden","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2002-01-01","2002","2000s","Sonic Team","SEGA","Unknown","Unknown","1","1","1","","","Like the Chao Adventure mini-game on consoles, Tiny Chao Garden allows the player to take their Chao with them and raise it on their Game Boy Advance. The Chao does not age like it does in Sonic Adventure, so the player has plenty of time to raise all of its stats to level 99. The player must pause the game and select Save &amp; Exit for progress in the Tiny Chao Garden to be recorded. Simply turning the system off will not save progress.","Tiny Chao Garden (NA, Phantasy Star Online Episode I &amp; II GameCube Link).gba","GBA","0","false","false","false","false","false","false","false","false","","","","","","",""
