"gba_tom-clancy-s-rainbow-six-rogue-spear","Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six : Rogue Spear","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2002-03-14","2002","2000s","Ubisoft","Ubisoft","Shooter","Shooter","1-4","1","4","80","4","Back in full force is Tom Clancy's hallmark realism and suspense in Rogue Spear?, the sequel to PC Gamer's 1998 Action Game of the Year - Rainbow Six?.
Rogue Spear straddles the razor's edge separating justice from the dark forces of geopolitical turmoil. It blends spine-tingling tactics and explosive action into intense counter-terrorist warfare.
Lead the RAINBOW team of elite multi-national special operatives against two deadly terrorist organizations. Life or death missions will take you to real world settings across the globe, including a Jumbo Jet airplane and the Museum of Art. Rogue Spear seems so real, you'll be yelling ""Tango Down"" in your sleep for weeks.","Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six - Rogue Spear (NA).gba","GBA","8","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","covers/gba/Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six - Rogue Spear (NA).png","miximages/gba/Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six - Rogue Spear (NA).png","screenshots/gba/Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six - Rogue Spear (NA).png","titlescreens/gba/Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six - Rogue Spear (NA).png","3dboxes/gba/Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six - Rogue Spear (NA).png","backcovers/gba/Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six - Rogue Spear (NA).png","marquees/gba/Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six - Rogue Spear (NA).png"
