"gba_ultimate-arcade-games","Ultimate Arcade Games","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2005-10-15","2005","2000s","Telegames","Telegames","Unknown","Unknown","1","1","1","50","2.5","Ultimate Arcade Games is a collection of 12 arcade-style games, inspired by a variety of popular classics. Each game utilizes core gameplay ideas from classic arcade games, while expanding and improving each game for a new generation of gamers.

