"gba_urban-yeti","Urban Yeti!","gba","Nintendo Game Boy Advance","Game Boy Advance","Nintendo","6. kynslóð (32-bit Handheld)","2002-08-16","2002","2000s","Cave Barn","Telegames","Adventure","Adventure","1","1","1","60","3","Urban Yeti is is a smooth scrolling 2 1/2-D platform adventure, and might very well be the strangest game you've ever played. You can smash your way through 4 twisting city stages, or attempt to avoid detection all together. Either way the Human AI will adapt as you progress - the more contact you have, the more aggressive they'll become. There are even some unique minigames to add to the excitement - Yeti Frisbee, managing the local ""Yeti Kingdom Of Eats"" restaurant, and catching poultry to offer to your prospective mate. You can even float down a lazy sewer river o' fun on a giant tube! Achieve the ultimate goal and show the world just what kind of Bigfoot you really are.","Urban Yeti! (NA).gba","GBA","4","true","true","true","true","true","true","true","false","covers/gba/Urban Yeti! (NA).png","miximages/gba/Urban Yeti! (NA).png","screenshots/gba/Urban Yeti! (NA).png","titlescreens/gba/Urban Yeti! (NA).png","3dboxes/gba/Urban Yeti! (NA).png","backcovers/gba/Urban Yeti! (NA).png","marquees/gba/Urban Yeti! (NA).png"
